Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2}（网飞公司）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.29,0:00:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}制作公司\N双重挑战公司
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\shad1\bord1\1c00CCCCCC\b1}（序幕）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\shad1\bord1\1c00CCCCCC\b1}（极北之地 1857年）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,船长！\N{\rEng}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,船长！\N{\rEng}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,能聊聊吗？\N{\rEng}Can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须破冰前行\N{\rEng}We must break through the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都很饿 也累坏了\N{\rEng}The men are hungry and exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,要是继续这样下去 恐怕会付出代价\N{\rEng}We cannot keep up this pace without consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,大家听着！\N{\rEng}Listen up, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拖得越久 冰就冻得越牢固\N{\rEng}The more we delay the labor, the firmer the grasp of the ice will become.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,继续干活\N{\rEng}The work continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,各组轮流作业\N{\rEng}Rotate each group.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.79,0:01:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 请听我说\N{\rEng}Sir, with respect…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,大家需要一句准话\N{\rEng}The men need assurances.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,准话？\N{\rEng}Assurances?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是让船动起来之后 我们会回圣彼得堡去\N{\rEng}Yes, that we will head back to St. Petersburg once we free the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他们觉得我们的船航行不了多久了 他们想知道…\N{\rEng}They don't think we'll be seaworthy for long and they want to know--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.66,0:01:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,都听好了！\N{\rEng}Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别的任何事情 都不是你们和这位长官该考虑的\N{\rEng}It is neither your place, nor the officer here, to think anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.95,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们接受了一项任务 就要把它完成\N{\rEng}We signed up for a mission and we will see it to completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定会到达北极\N{\rEng}We will reach the North Pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,都听明白了吗？\N{\rEng}Is it understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,船长 那里爆炸了…\N{\rEng}An explosion, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,离这里大约三公里\N{\rEng}About two miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,去救人\N{\rEng}Get the men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,雪橇犬没受伤\N{\rEng}The sled dogs are unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那这血是哪来的？\N{\rEng}Then where does all this blood come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,船长 在那里！\N{\rEng}Over here, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.37,0:03:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有个受了伤的人 他流了好多血\N{\rEng}A wounded man, he's lost a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,肩膀受伤了 腿断了\N{\rEng}Wound to the shoulder, his leg is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是被熊咬的吗？\N{\rEng}Bear attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得不是 船长\N{\rEng}I don't think so, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.95,0:03:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,拉森 来帮我把这只靴子脱下来\N{\rEng}Larsen, help me with his boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是个假肢\N{\rEng}A prosthetic leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,把他抬船上去\N{\rEng}Put him on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,快 抬上船 赶紧！\N{\rEng}Hurry! To the ship! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.83,0:04:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,拉森 那东西来了\N{\rEng}Larsen, that thing is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,步枪准备！\N{\rEng}Ready the rifles!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,听我指令\N{\rEng}On my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准！\N{\rEng}Aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.79,0:04:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,开火！\N{\rEng}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,下一组！\N{\rEng}Next group!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,开火！\N{\rEng}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,全部上船！\N{\rEng}All to the ship!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们抬上船的那个人呢？\N{\rEng}Where is that man we brought onboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪里？\N{\rEng}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那究竟是什么东西？它想干什么？\N{\rEng}What is that thing? What does it want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.12,0:05:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把他给我！\N{\rEng}Bring him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,喇叭枪 拉森 拿喇叭枪！\N{\rEng}The blunderbuss. Larsen, get the blunderbuss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.91,0:06:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀了它\N{\rEng}I killed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.41,0:06:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀了它\N{\rEng}I killed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.95,0:06:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,它还活着！\N{\rEng}It's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,梯子！\N{\rEng}Ladder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,快收梯子！\N{\rEng}Pull up the ladder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,把他交出来！\N{\rEng}Bring him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还剩几发？\N{\rEng}How many shots are left?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一发 但杀不了它\N{\rEng}One, but it can't kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\rEng}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不是要打他\N{\rEng}I'm not aiming for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是鸦片酊 能止痛 喝吧\N{\rEng}Laudanum, to ease the pain. Drink it. Drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我这是在哪里？\N{\rEng}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.62,0:08:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是丹麦皇家航船霍莱松特号\N{\rEng}You are on the Royal Danish ship, Horisont.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我是安德森船长 这位是邬德森医生\N{\rEng}I'm Captain Anderson. This is Dr. Udsen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那怪物杀了你们多少人？\N{\rEng}How many of your men did it kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,六个\N{\rEng}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,它会回来 让更多人丧命\N{\rEng}It will come back and kill many more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要是不把我交出去 你们都会没命\N{\rEng}All of you, if necessary, unless you deliver me to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的 它不在了\N{\rEng}No, no. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,它沉入了冰水 死了\N{\rEng}It sank in the freezing waters. It's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,它没死！\N{\rEng}No, it is not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.66,0:08:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,它死不了\N{\rEng}It cannot die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.45,0:08:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直尝试彻底摧毁它\N{\rEng}I have tried to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你们信不信\N{\rEng}Whether you believe me or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:09:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,它都会回来 找我\N{\rEng}it will come back… for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等它真的回来了\N{\rEng}And when it does,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要把我送到外面的冰面上\N{\rEng}you must promise that you will put me out on the ice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,让它带走我\N{\rEng}and let it take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,求你们了\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那究竟是什么？\N{\rEng}What manner of creature is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么样的魔鬼造出来的？\N{\rEng}What manner of devil made him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是我\N{\rEng}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\rEng}I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是我亲手造的他\N{\rEng}I made him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.87,0:09:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我本已下定决心 让那些罪恶的记忆和我一同消亡\N{\rEng}I had determined that the memory of my evils should die with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\rEng}It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来我要说的话 有些是真的\N{\rEng}Some of what I will tell you is fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有些是假的 但这是真的\N{\rEng}Some is not, but it is all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫维克多\N{\rEng}My name is Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多·弗兰肯斯坦\N{\rEng}Victor Frankenstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是父亲起的\N{\rEng}It was my father who gave me that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.83,0:09:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这名字是什么意思吗？\N{\rEng}Do you know what it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是征服者的意思\N{\rEng}I believe I do, yes. Conqueror.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:09:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,赢得一切的人\N{\rEng}One that wins it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:09:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 一切因他而起\N{\rEng}Yes. It all started with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的父亲\N{\rEng}My father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我的母亲\N{\rEng}And my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\shad1\bord1\1c00CCCCCC\b1}（第一部分 维克多的故事）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.66,0:10:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快下来 你父亲来了\N{\rEng}Come down, your father is arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈？\N{\rEng}Maman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲 我在这里\N{\rEng}I'm here, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.91,0:10:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这里\N{\rEng}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲是男爵 也是个杰出的外科医生\N{\rEng}My father was a baron and a preeminent surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他娶我母亲 很大程度上为了利益\N{\rEng}He had married my mother largely out of convenience,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,因为母亲的陪嫁相当丰厚 而且她是贵族出身\N{\rEng}as her dowry was considerable and her lineage noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她带来的资金 足以让父亲维持爵位和家族产业\N{\rEng}It furnished my father with the means to preserve his rank and family estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,日常生活中 从来看不见父亲的身影\N{\rEng}He was absent from our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,而每当他回到家 所有人都对他唯命是从\N{\rEng}but when he came home, the entire household bent to his will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的克莱尔\N{\rEng}Claire, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在的时候…\N{\rEng}The rest of the time…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\rEng}Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.33,0:11:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他不在的时候 母亲就是我一个人的\N{\rEng}The rest of the time, Mother was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别拿走 端到这里来\N{\rEng}No, bring that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.04,0:11:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,肉里的盐分能滋养你的血液\N{\rEng}The salts in the meat will enrich your blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.25,0:11:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还有胎儿的\N{\rEng}as well as the baby's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一人吃 两人补 记得吗？\N{\rEng}You eat for two, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,吃吧\N{\rEng}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,很有营养\N{\rEng}It's nutritious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,守护天使\N{\rEng}Guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,甜蜜的陪伴\N{\rEng}Sweet companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,请守护我 不要离开我\N{\rEng}Stand by my side and do not leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.12,0:12:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,用你的披风庇护我 然后…\N{\rEng}Under your mantle, shelter me, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我隔着墙听到他们争论不休\N{\rEng}I would hear them through the wall, arguing incessantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对着彼此大吼大叫 话题关于财富和庄园 还有我\N{\rEng}yelling at each other about wealth, estate… and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.79,0:12:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的争吵声让我万分恐惧\N{\rEng}Their voices filled me with fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈？\N{\rEng}Maman?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈？\N{\rEng}Maman?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那个男人鄙视我们两个\N{\rEng}The man despised us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌我们乌黑的头发、深色的瞳孔\N{\rEng}Our raven black hair, our deep, dark eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就连我们喜好安静、不时紧张的性情\N{\rEng}Even our quiet, at times nervous disposition
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.87,0:12:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎也会让他大为光火\N{\rEng}seemed to exasperate him to no end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,古代把体液分为哪几类？\N{\rEng}List as accurately as you can the ancient classification
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量说精确一点\N{\rEng}of the humors in the human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,血液、黑胆汁、黄胆汁和黏液\N{\rEng}Blood, black bile, yellow bile, and phlegm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,男性心脏的平均重量是多少？\N{\rEng}Average male heart. Weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,250到310克 父亲\N{\rEng}Nine to eleven ounces, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,女性心脏的平均重量？\N{\rEng}Average female heart. Weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,230到280克\N{\rEng}Eight to ten ounces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么觉得\N{\rEng}Why do you suppose that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,女性的心脏会轻一点？\N{\rEng}Difference in mass in female heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为她们情感更强烈？\N{\rEng}Depth of emotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,更容易忧郁吗？\N{\rEng}Tendency to the melancholic?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为质量 血流量 肌肉灌注的不同 父亲\N{\rEng}Mass. Volume of blood, Father. Muscular irrigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 人体组织中没有精神物质\N{\rEng}Quite. There is no spiritual content in tissue,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.41,0:13:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,肌肉中没有情感\N{\rEng}and no emotion in a muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 请描述一下三尖瓣的主要功能\N{\rEng}Now, describe the main function of the tricuspid valve, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在想不起来了 父亲 但我肯定能想起来\N{\rEng}I cannot recall, Father, but I'm sure I will remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我相信你\N{\rEng}Yeah, I'm sure you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:13:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,象牙不会流血 维克多\N{\rEng}Ivory does not bleed, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.08,0:14:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但人体会\N{\rEng}Flesh does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.33,0:14:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,等你想起了某个知识要点 恐怕你的病人已经一命呜呼了\N{\rEng}By the time you remember a fact, your patient could be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了吗？\N{\rEng}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,三尖瓣的主要功能\N{\rEng}The main function of the tricuspid valve
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是防止血液反流至腔静脉\N{\rEng}is to prevent the reflux of blood into the vena cava.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不打手了 再也不打了\N{\rEng}No, not your hands. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,它们如今是你施展技艺的工具 是你意志的延伸\N{\rEng}They are now the instruments of your craft and will,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要好好保护\N{\rEng}and we must care for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,而你的脸 就微不足道了\N{\rEng}Your face, however, is vanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多 你沿用了我的名字 也必然要维护我的名声\N{\rEng}You bear my name, Victor, and with it my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.75,0:14:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我恳请你牢记这一点\N{\rEng}I pray you remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.25,0:15:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉你有很好的牌\N{\rEng}I feel you have something very good, parce que…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.83,0:15:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,三\N{\rEng}Three…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,二\N{\rEng}Two…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一\N{\rEng}One…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\rEng}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我来洗牌\N{\rEng}I'll shuffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲？\N{\rEng}Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈？\N{\rEng}Maman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\rEng}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲 母亲出事了\N{\rEng}Father. It's Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\rEng}Maman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好热水和干净的亚麻布 多拿一点 快\N{\rEng}I need hot water and clean linen. A lot of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是 先生\N{\rEng}-Now. -Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-不 维克多 -妈妈？\N{\rEng}-No, Victor! -Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-妈妈! -维克多!\N{\rEng}-Maman! -Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲！\N{\rEng}Father! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要救她 求你了！\N{\rEng}-Victor! -Save her, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的母亲 我曾将她视作我的一部分\N{\rEng}My mother, whom I had come to consider a part of my very self,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾以为她永远不会离去\N{\rEng}she who I thought would never leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,以为她是我的生命 如今她死了\N{\rEng}she who was life… was now death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.75,0:16:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她的双眼已暗淡无光\N{\rEng}Her eyes extinguished,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,笑容被冰冷的土地埋葬\N{\rEng}her smile feeding the cold earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,走开！\N{\rEng}Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,都给我走开！\N{\rEng}All of you, leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.00,0:17:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的世界空了一块\N{\rEng}A part of the universe had been hollowed out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的头顶笼罩着永远的黑暗\N{\rEng}and the firmament was now permanently dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,遮住眼睛\N{\rEng}Now, cover your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.37,0:17:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你看再看哦\N{\rEng}Don't look until I tell you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧\N{\rEng}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉在阳光和笑容中长大\N{\rEng}William grew full of sunshine and smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他的性情比我平和温顺 显然更讨父亲喜欢\N{\rEng}He was of a calmer, gentler disposition, clearly favored by my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 父亲\N{\rEng}Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不客气 儿子\N{\rEng}Oh, it's a pleasure, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他是宜人的微风 我是滚滚的黑云\N{\rEng}He was the breeze, I was the storm cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他带来欢声笑语 我让人愁眉不展\N{\rEng}He was all laughter, I was all frowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,拿起缰绳\N{\rEng}Pick up the reins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲 看我做得怎么样\N{\rEng}Look at me, Father. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.79,0:18:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不止如此\N{\rEng}There was something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,更确切地说 某些东西被忽视了\N{\rEng}Or rather, something was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的母亲\N{\rEng}My mother had died
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,死在如日中天的名医\N{\rEng}at the hands of the most distinguished doctor of his day:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的父亲手下\N{\rEng}My father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我的脑中渐渐有了个想法\N{\rEng}An idea… took shape in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,请说说《心血运动论》中…\N{\rEng}Define the circulatory system, if you will…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,无可避免 无法逃避\N{\rEng}Inevitable, unavoidable…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,…对循环系统是怎么定义的\N{\rEng}…as enunciated in De Motu Cordis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,…直到这个想法被说了出来\N{\rEng}…until it became truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.54,0:18:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲？\N{\rEng}Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.45,0:18:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你没救她 对吗？\N{\rEng}You let her die, did you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我用尽全力救她了 你必须知道这一点\N{\rEng}I did everything in my power to save her. You must know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说 你失败了\N{\rEng}So you failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.37,0:18:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能战胜死亡\N{\rEng}-No one can conquer death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我能 我会战胜的\N{\rEng}I will. I will conquer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我会掌握你掌握的所有知识 还会更进一步\N{\rEng}Everything you know, I will know. And more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就到此为止吧\N{\rEng}I think we've done quite enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那晚我重生了\N{\rEng}I was born anew that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.83,0:19:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了幻象\N{\rEng}I had a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.37,0:19:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次看到了\N{\rEng}I saw, for the first time…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.12,0:19:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗天使\N{\rEng}the Dark Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.83,0:19:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,它向我许下承诺\N{\rEng}And it made me a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我将能掌控生死\N{\rEng}I would have command over the forces of life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,成为和父亲一样杰出的外科医生\N{\rEng}I would become every ounce the surgeon my father was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.33,0:19:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我的野心和成就将超过他\N{\rEng}I would surpass him in ambition and in reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,守护天使…\N{\rEng}Guardian angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,幻象如此清晰\N{\rEng}The vision was so clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,无论清醒还是睡梦中 我都从未看到如此清晰的景象\N{\rEng}Clearer than anything I'd ever seen in my waking hours or dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:19:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但承诺如何兑现？\N{\rEng}But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我的境遇很快一落千丈\N{\rEng}My downfall was swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.75,0:20:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲的种植园 经历了两次叛乱和一场火灾\N{\rEng}Two revolts and a fire on my mother's plantations
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,家族财富因此锐减\N{\rEng}dwindled the family fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,庄园留下了 但别的全都没了\N{\rEng}We kept the estate, but lost everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉被送去了维也纳的亲戚家\N{\rEng}William went to one side of the family in Vienna
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我去了伦敦 然后又去了爱丁堡\N{\rEng}and I to London, then Edinburgh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.83,0:20:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里 我花了数十年时间\N{\rEng}And there, for decades, I tried to…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,尝试为狭隘的学术界拓宽边界\N{\rEng}expand the narrow limits of academia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,生命\N{\rEng}Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是生命 先生们\N{\rEng}This… is life, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.58,0:21:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\shad1\bord1\1c00CCCCCC\b1}（皇家医学院纪律法庭 1855年）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出生了\N{\rEng}We are born.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,刚上去没多久 就掉下来了\N{\rEng}And no sooner do we rise, we fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.41,0:21:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,死了\N{\rEng}Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这一起一落之间\N{\rEng}And in the space between that rise and fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我们渺小卑微的一生\N{\rEng}our humble little purview.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,出生不为我们所控\N{\rEng}Now, birth is not in our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对？\N{\rEng}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.45,0:21:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,生命之火的点燃 思想和灵魂的诞生\N{\rEng}Conception, that spark, the animation of thought and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,掌握在上帝的手中\N{\rEng}That is in God's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\rEng}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,而死亡\N{\rEng}But death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.04,0:21:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,挑战正在此处\N{\rEng}Ah, now there lies the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡应该掌握在我们手中\N{\rEng}That should be our concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,应该如此\N{\rEng}It should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:21:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们凭什么能掌控？ 我们又不是神明 对不对？\N{\rEng}Who are we to do so? We are not gods, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.41,0:22:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但要是我们能像神明那般大胆\N{\rEng}But if we are to behave as immodestly as gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.75,0:22:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那至少能够创造奇迹\N{\rEng}we must, at the very least, deliver miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是？\N{\rEng}Wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.25,0:22:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在年轻学子心中点燃神圣火花\N{\rEng}Ignite a divine spark…in these young students' minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,教导他们抛弃顺从 违抗权威\N{\rEng}Teach them defiance rather than obedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,展示人类有可能掌控自然奥秘 让死亡不再发生\N{\rEng}Show that man may pursue nature to her hiding places and stop death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.54,0:22:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是延缓死亡 而是长生不老！\N{\rEng}Not slow it down, but stop it entirely!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.58,0:22:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,安静！\N{\rEng}Silence. Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.91,0:22:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这种不可能的事 你究竟要怎么教？\N{\rEng}How exactly do you propose to teach what is impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,人类的尸体 一个复合实体\N{\rEng}Composite subject, the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这是某个店老板 刚咽气没多久就送到了我这里\N{\rEng}That of a shopkeeper, delivered mere moments after expiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大脑暴露在外 但仍能运作\N{\rEng}The brain laid bare but functional,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.62,0:22:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,脊神经分支和迷走神经完好无损\N{\rEng}the spinal branches and vagal nerves intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.70,0:22:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大家或许能看到一些极细的伤口\N{\rEng}You may observe the hair-thin scars.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手艺无需粗糙的缝合\N{\rEng}No coarse stitching needed by my own technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看这条手臂\N{\rEng}The arm, you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,来自某个木匠\N{\rEng}comes from another specimen, that of a carpenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,肌肉、韧带、神经 都已连结好\N{\rEng}The muscles, ligaments, nerves, all connected now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊 电流导致躯体痉挛\N{\rEng}Now, the spasmodic movement of the body
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.12,0:23:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这已不是新鲜事\N{\rEng}caused from the electric current, this is not new.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.70,0:23:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都见过 不过 这种躯体内的能量流动\N{\rEng}It's not new. However, the flow of energy through the body
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,遵循一种完全不同的概念\N{\rEng}follows a different notion entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.45,0:23:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一种称为气的东方概念\N{\rEng}An Eastern notion called qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.91,0:23:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这种概念认为 生命能量的流动 同时存在于身体内外\N{\rEng}Now, it considers the vital flow of energy both within and without.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我用针在六个…\N{\rEng}I'm utilizing needles in six--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.95,0:23:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,安静！都坐下！\N{\rEng}Quiet! Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.75,0:23:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,医生 这是听证会 不是狂欢节表演\N{\rEng}This is a hearing, Doctor, not a carnival act.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.12,0:23:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样无济于事 维克多\N{\rEng}You're not helping your cause, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.16,0:24:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这种用电的诡计根本没用\N{\rEng}This galvanic trickery will simply not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.83,0:24:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,诡计\N{\rEng}Trickery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.75,0:24:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,诡计？\N{\rEng}Trickery?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.04,0:24:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\rEng}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是诡计 而是一种抉择\N{\rEng}That is not trickery. That is a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.83,0:24:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一个死人的眼睛 和另一个死人的胳膊协调运动\N{\rEng}Motor coordination between the eye of one dead man and the arm of another,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.25,0:24:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,注入全新的意志和基本的理解力\N{\rEng}infused with a new will and the rudiments of understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.87,0:24:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,已经死亡的大脑也有理解力吗？\N{\rEng}Understanding in a brain that already died?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.54,0:24:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,放开\N{\rEng}Release now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.04,0:24:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,请放开\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.45,0:24:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,礼貌一点总有效果\N{\rEng}"Please" always helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.00,0:24:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧关了吧 你个江湖骗子\N{\rEng}Turn that off at once. At once, you charlatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.25,0:24:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是未来 这是有可能实现的\N{\rEng}This is the future. This is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.20,0:24:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不研究一下 量化一下呢？\N{\rEng}Why not study it? Why not quantify it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.37,0:24:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这是罪恶的 可恨、下流！\N{\rEng}This is unholy. An abomination. An obscenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.16,0:24:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,生命由上帝赐予 由上帝收回 维克多\N{\rEng}God gives life, and God takes it, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.00,0:24:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,或许上帝就是无能！\N{\rEng}Perhaps God is inept!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.91,0:25:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要由我们来纠正他的错误！\N{\rEng}And it is we that must amend his mistakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.41,0:25:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别让这些老蠢货阻止你自由表达！\N{\rEng}Do not let these old fools extinguish your voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.04,0:25:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只有采取不盲从的态度 摆脱恐惧和恃强凌弱的教条\N{\rEng}The answers only come when coaxed by disobedience,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.50,0:25:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,答案才会浮现！\N{\rEng}free of fear and cowardly dogma!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.87,0:25:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,克伦佩教授\N{\rEng}Professor Krempe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.04,0:26:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰肯斯坦男爵 我叫海因里希·哈兰德\N{\rEng}Baron Frankenstein, my name is Heinrich Harlander,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.95,0:26:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我这里有一封\N{\rEng}and I carry with me a letter of introduction
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.79,0:26:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你的弟弟威廉写的介绍信\N{\rEng}from your brother, William.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.25,0:26:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我弟弟？\N{\rEng}From my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.29,0:26:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望能有幸认识你\N{\rEng}I asked for the privilege of your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.75,0:26:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,耽误你一点时间\N{\rEng}It won't take but a minute of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.70,0:26:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-请进 -好\N{\rEng}-Please. -Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.58,0:26:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说 威廉要来看我 对吗？\N{\rEng}So William is coming to see me, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.45,0:26:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对 几天后到\N{\rEng}Yeah, in a matter of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.87,0:26:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他想让你见见他的未婚妻 也就是我的侄女\N{\rEng}He wants to introduce you to his fiancée. My niece, as it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.41,0:26:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她叫伊丽莎白·哈兰德 是一位非常可爱的小姐\N{\rEng}Elizabeth Harlander, a very nice young lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.29,0:26:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚从修道院学校毕业\N{\rEng}fresh from convent life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.41,0:26:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这些照片都是我拍的\N{\rEng}The photographs are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.91,0:26:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉在金融领域很有成就\N{\rEng}William has become quite successful in the world of finance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.12,0:26:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,弗兰肯斯坦的名声越来越响了\N{\rEng}He's making a name for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.91,0:26:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哎哟！是吗？\N{\rEng}Ha! A name? For himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.50,0:26:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,要知道我们都是弗兰肯斯坦 不管我们乐不乐意\N{\rEng}Well, I'm afraid we both share that name, whether we like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.12,0:26:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我拜读了你在《柳叶刀》上的文章\N{\rEng}I read your article in The Lancet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.37,0:26:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的觉得这事能做到吗？\N{\rEng}You really believe you can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.29,0:26:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,组装出一个人来？\N{\rEng}Assemble a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.58,0:27:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,做出完整的全新人体？还要有生命？\N{\rEng}A full new body? And give it life?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.79,0:27:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天也看到了\N{\rEng}You saw it today, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.29,0:27:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 我看到的是你当众受难\N{\rEng}What I saw was a crucifixion, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.70,0:27:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没开口说句话 就被钉死了\N{\rEng}You were done for before you uttered a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.41,0:27:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还是向他们展示了\N{\rEng}I still showed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.87,0:27:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,展示什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.79,0:27:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,事实\N{\rEng}The truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.41,0:27:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们到晚餐时间就忘了\N{\rEng}They will forget by suppertime.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.50,0:27:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,话虽如此 你觉得怎么样？\N{\rEng}Yes, yes, yes. But what did you think? 
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.04,0:27:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得非常厉害\N{\rEng}I thought it was brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.08,0:27:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我就知道\N{\rEng}It was. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.25,0:27:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但你有点孩子气 太激动了\N{\rEng}But you are like a child, so excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.12,0:27:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,紧抓你的新宠物 快把它勒死了\N{\rEng}clutching your new pet so tightly that you're strangling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.50,0:27:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不免为你担心\N{\rEng}That is why I worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.70,0:27:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你能控制好火种吗 普罗米修斯？\N{\rEng}Can you contain your fire, Prometheus?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.25,0:27:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还是没等把它交出去 就先烧伤了自己的手？\N{\rEng}Or are you going to burn your hands before delivering it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.54,0:27:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,说得对\N{\rEng}Quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.41,0:27:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要觉得我无礼 但这一天已经足够漫长\N{\rEng}Please do not think me rude, but my day has proven long enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.00,0:27:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我的状态也完全不适合 再陪伴陌生人了\N{\rEng}and I believe myself totally unfit for the company of strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.12,0:27:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没有什么别的事了…\N{\rEng}So if there's nothing more--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.70,0:27:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还有重要的事\N{\rEng}Oh, but there is. Much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.20,0:28:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我在爱丁堡找好了住处\N{\rEng}I've taken quarters in Edinburgh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.75,0:28:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,三天后 我们一起见威廉和伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}Three days from now, we are to meet with William and Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.25,0:28:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我将在那晚改变你的命运\N{\rEng}And that evening, I will change your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.70,0:28:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你看到非同凡响的东西\N{\rEng}I will show you something extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.41,0:28:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,桃子 把桃子转过来\N{\rEng}The peach. The peach. Turn the peach. Turn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.70,0:28:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你又啃了\N{\rEng}You bit it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.33,0:28:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直在吃桃\N{\rEng}You're eating the peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.50,0:28:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这是对死亡的沉思\N{\rEng}This is a memento mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.04,0:28:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,桃子是生命和青春的符号 怎么就被你啃了？\N{\rEng}The peach, symbol of life and youth, and you bite into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.50,0:28:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-我饿了呀 小希 -别那样叫我\N{\rEng}-I was hungry, Kiki. -Don't call me Kiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.79,0:28:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 维克多·弗兰肯斯坦男爵来了\N{\rEng}Baron Victor Frankenstein, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.04,0:28:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以下去了\N{\rEng}You can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.66,0:28:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\rEng}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.33,0:29:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\rEng}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.29,0:29:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哈兰德先生\N{\rEng}Herr Harlander.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.20,0:29:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一种新兴艺术 摄影\N{\rEng}A young art, photography.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.95,0:29:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 小希\N{\rEng}Goodbye, Kiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.41,0:29:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经迷上了\N{\rEng}Already a passion of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.75,0:29:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,文件都带来了吗？\N{\rEng}Did you bring the papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.54,0:29:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.20,0:29:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-你非常出色 -谢谢\N{\rEng}-You're extraordinary. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.37,0:29:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你利用神经系统来传递能量脉冲\N{\rEng}You're using the nervous system to deliver the surge of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.70,0:29:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗？\N{\rEng}Are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.75,0:29:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.00,0:29:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因此 你所操控的生命力 只能维持很短时间\N{\rEng}And thus the sustainability of the life force you command
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.08,0:29:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就会衰退、消散\N{\rEng}is very brief, wanes, evaporates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.00,0:29:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这么说？\N{\rEng}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.00,0:29:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,当时你颇为自豪地结束了演示\N{\rEng}At the lecture, you ended your demonstration out of pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.41,0:29:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但其实是因为 那股电流般的生命力\N{\rEng}But really, because the galvanic life force
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.75,0:29:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,已经衰竭了 对吗？\N{\rEng}was already fading, was it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.58,0:29:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 你是外科医生吗？\N{\rEng}Are you yourself a surgeon, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.70,0:30:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经是 我是战地医生\N{\rEng}Yeah, once upon a time. An army surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.12,0:30:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,医术也说不上多精湛\N{\rEng}Not a particularly skilled one, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.79,0:30:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但也给我打下了发家致富的基础\N{\rEng}But it allowed me to secure the rudiments of my fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.04,0:30:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在有几家军火工厂\N{\rEng}I own a few ammunition factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.04,0:30:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-你是军火商 -不如说是个务实的\N{\rEng}-An arms merchant. -A realist.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.45,0:30:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你对伊夫林解剖图表熟悉吗？\N{\rEng}Are you familiar with the Evelyn Tables?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.41,0:30:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 那是约翰·伊夫林爵士当年\N{\rEng}Of course. Acquired by Sir John Evelyn,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.04,0:30:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,买下的四张人体标本精细解剖图\N{\rEng}there are four planks, meticulous dissection,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.08,0:30:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是欧洲最早的人体神经 和动静脉解剖图\N{\rEng}some of the oldest in Europe, presenting the nerves,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.20,0:30:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会提到这个？\N{\rEng}veins and arteries of cadavers. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.16,0:30:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为还有第五张\N{\rEng}Yes. But there's a fifth one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.91,0:30:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这张最让人信服\N{\rEng}The most compelling one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.33,0:30:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,非常细致 是不是？\N{\rEng}Exquisite, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.50,0:30:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,呈现于木头上的鲜活血肉\N{\rEng}Flesh rendered onto wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.29,0:30:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体放在木板上 逐层剥离\N{\rEng}The cadaver lies on the plank, is peeled away layer by layer,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.66,0:30:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,用树脂将剩下的组织固定在木板上\N{\rEng}and the remaining tissue is lacquered with resin onto the wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.45,0:30:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是淋巴系统 -没错\N{\rEng}-It showcases the lymphatic system. -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.83,0:30:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,穆斯林医学家称其为隐秘的循环系统\N{\rEng}Muslim medics called it the secret circulatory system.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.70,0:30:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,仅仅输送三升体液 却构成了庞大的网络\N{\rEng}It moves a mere three liters of fluid, but it's a vast network.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.29,0:31:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-真是非同凡响 -确实\N{\rEng}-Oh, it's remarkable. -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.16,0:31:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,现在对我们 也是对你而言 关键的改变就在这里\N{\rEng}Now for us, for you, the important variation is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.62,0:31:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这第九种构造 环绕心脏的结构\N{\rEng}The ninth configuration. A very delicate,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.37,0:31:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,极为精巧 近乎空灵\N{\rEng}almost ethereal structure surrounding the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.83,0:31:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,既能分配能量 也能储存能量\N{\rEng}It can distribute, but also store energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.79,0:31:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能在不破坏周围组织的前提下\N{\rEng}Yes, if you can access that without destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.33,0:31:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-触达这一构造… -不 不是前面\N{\rEng}-the surrounding tissue-- -No. Not through the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.95,0:31:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是后面 脊柱 胸曲\N{\rEng}The back, spinal column, thoracic curvature.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.95,0:31:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.91,0:31:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,远超人们想象的能量流动 瘢痕形成和组织再生\N{\rEng}Flow of energy, scarring and regeneration beyond anyone's imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.41,0:31:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,永生\N{\rEng}Life eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.70,0:31:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我将提供无限的资源 来支持你的研究\N{\rEng}I will endow your pursuit with unlimited resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.79,0:31:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要拿什么来交换？\N{\rEng}And in exchange?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.75,0:31:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说就俗了\N{\rEng}No need to become indelicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.25,0:31:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们探寻真理 志在超越 有着共同的追求\N{\rEng}We're searchers for truth and transcendence, kindred spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.41,0:31:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,某天我也许会请你帮个忙 作为回报\N{\rEng}I may in time ask you for a favor in return,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.45,0:32:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但最重要的是记录研究过程 以传诸后世的这份特权\N{\rEng}but it's mostly the privilege to record your process for posterity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.54,0:32:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我习惯独自工作\N{\rEng}I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.00,0:32:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对不出声\N{\rEng}I'm very quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.25,0:32:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哈兰德先生 威廉·弗兰肯斯坦和您的侄女到了\N{\rEng}William Frankenstein and your niece, Herr Harlander.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.08,0:32:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我要考虑一下\N{\rEng}I shall consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.54,0:32:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我会考虑的\N{\rEng}I'll consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.95,0:32:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,男爵\N{\rEng}Baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.12,0:32:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别假装冷静了 错过了就可惜了\N{\rEng}Don't pretend to be reasonable now. It would be such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.62,0:32:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.04,0:32:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉！\N{\rEng}William!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.25,0:32:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-维克多 -瞧瞧你\N{\rEng}-Victor. -Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.95,0:32:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,老天 你长大了\N{\rEng}My, you've grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.70,0:32:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜不是我的功劳\N{\rEng}Through no merit of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.04,0:32:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,来见见我的未婚妻吧\N{\rEng}May I introduce the woman I'm to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.70,0:32:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白·哈兰德小姐\N{\rEng}Lady Elizabeth Harlander.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.70,0:33:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,荣幸之至\N{\rEng}Absolutely delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.95,0:33:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,听到你被驱逐 说实话我也不惊讶\N{\rEng}Can't say I was shocked when you were expelled,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.87,0:33:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们的态度太强硬 言语太狠毒\N{\rEng}but the manner and virulence of your expulsion,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.54,0:33:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为实在没有必要\N{\rEng}uncalled for, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.79,0:33:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有必要\N{\rEng}No, it was called for. 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.00,0:33:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我应得的\N{\rEng}I earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.50,0:33:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我特意挣来的 你说是不是 哈兰德先生？\N{\rEng}I made it a point to earn it, wouldn't you say, Herr Harlander?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.08,0:33:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,确实声势浩大\N{\rEng}It was quite an exit, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.33,0:33:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要激怒他们？\N{\rEng}Why provoke them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.50,0:33:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,何不继续做自己的事 避免惹来不必要的关注？\N{\rEng}Why not just carry on without calling attention to yourself in such a manner?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.95,0:33:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉 就算以你的标准来看 这么做也太保守了\N{\rEng}How safe, even by your standards, William.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.70,0:33:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你这话听着都有点像父亲了\N{\rEng}You almost sound like Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.66,0:33:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲可是相当老练的\N{\rEng}He was a most tactful man, our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.20,0:33:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他做事精准、谨慎、有分寸感\N{\rEng}He was precise, discreet, measured.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.91,0:33:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不是 我完全不懂为何谦虚是一种美德\N{\rEng}I, on the other hand, fail to see why modesty is considered a virtue at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.45,0:33:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多一直这么引人注目\N{\rEng}Victor's always been one to harvest attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.33,0:34:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,即便在小时候 我也常常 通过保持沉默 来消解他的声音\N{\rEng}Even as children, I mitigated his voice by staying silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.70,0:34:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的事发生无数次了吧 维克多 你说呢？\N{\rEng}Perhaps too much and far too many times, wouldn't you say, Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.66,0:34:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以再造生命\N{\rEng}If life can be regenerated,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.95,0:34:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,并非简单的模拟\N{\rEng}not as a mere simulation,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.29,0:34:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,而是通过物理化学手段 如神迹般地再造 何不大声说出来？\N{\rEng}but as a divine act by physical, chemical means, why whisper it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.00,0:34:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你笑了？\N{\rEng}You laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.37,0:34:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-你觉得好笑吗？ -没错\N{\rEng}-You're amused? -I must be, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.79,0:34:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的理念没表达清楚吗？\N{\rEng}Are my ideas not clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.20,0:34:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你显然已经够大声的了\N{\rEng}You certainly expressed them loudly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.75,0:34:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不值得为之努力吗？\N{\rEng}Are they not worthwhile?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.08,0:34:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为理念本身并不值得为之努力\N{\rEng}Ideas are not worthwhile by themselves, I don't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.25,0:34:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,愿闻其详\N{\rEng}Enlighten me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.16,0:34:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,拿战争来说\N{\rEng}Take the war, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.45,0:34:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉 去书房享用雪茄和白兰地吧\N{\rEng}William, cigar and brandy in my study?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.58,0:34:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我侄女的长篇大论你肯定都听过了\N{\rEng}Surely you've heard my niece expound on the matter before.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.41,0:34:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们失陪了\N{\rEng}You'll excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.29,0:34:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,请继续说 关于理念\N{\rEng}Pray, carry on. Ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.45,0:34:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说吧 荣耀、国家、勇气\N{\rEng}Well… honor, country, valor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.62,0:35:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这些必然是值得为之奋斗的崇高理念\N{\rEng}These surely are worthwhile, elevated ideas by themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.79,0:35:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,同意吧？\N{\rEng}wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.29,0:35:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,然而 人们为了这些理念赴死\N{\rEng}-Mm-hmm. -And nevertheless, men are dying for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.04,0:35:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,以一种显然毫不崇高的方式\N{\rEng}In a decidedly un-elevated way,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.04,0:35:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,脸埋在泥泞里 喉咙呛着血\N{\rEng}face down in the mud, choking on blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.00,0:35:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,痛得大喊大叫\N{\rEng}screaming in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.04,0:35:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是某人的父亲、兄弟或儿子\N{\rEng}Men that were fathers, brothers or sons to someone out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.45,0:35:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们被自己的母亲带到这个世界\N{\rEng}Men that were fed, cleaned and nursed
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.45,0:35:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,被悉心喂养、洗净、照料、教育\N{\rEng}and schooled into this world by their mothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.91,0:35:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,最后却被送到某个遥远的战场\N{\rEng}only to fall on a battlefield far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.95,0:35:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真正制造惨剧的人却躲得远远的\N{\rEng}far from those that provoke these tragedies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.37,0:35:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他们好好地待在家中 不沾血 不挨刀\N{\rEng}Those men remain at home, untouched by blood or bayonet,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.41,0:35:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,皮肤完好无损 被窝温暖洁净\N{\rEng}their skin unpierced, their blankets warm and clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.12,0:35:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是蠢人追求理念的后果\N{\rEng}That is what happens when ideas are pursued by fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.95,0:35:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那你觉得我是蠢人\N{\rEng}And you think me a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.33,0:35:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快享用你的白兰地和雪茄去吧\N{\rEng}Run to your brandy and cigars.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.58,0:35:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都在等着呢\N{\rEng}The boys are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.33,0:36:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人常常以为遇见了天使或魔鬼\N{\rEng}How often a man believes he's met an angel or a devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.66,0:36:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,到头来却发现一切不过是幻觉\N{\rEng}only to find it is all an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.95,0:36:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们下的这盘棋\N{\rEng}The game of chess we play…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.91,0:36:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对手只有自己\N{\rEng}we play only against ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.16,0:36:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮他\N{\rEng}Help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.62,0:36:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\rEng}Help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.66,0:36:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,给 喝点吧\N{\rEng}Here you go. Drink some.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.20,0:36:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,快跟我来\N{\rEng}You better come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.87,0:36:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\rEng}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.29,0:36:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 看守人看到他了\N{\rEng}Sir, the watchman saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.79,0:36:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在迷雾中绕着船转\N{\rEng}Circling the ship. In the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.54,0:36:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都亲眼看他沉下去了\N{\rEng}We all saw him drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.25,0:36:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,先生\N{\rEng}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.50,0:36:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都很恐慌\N{\rEng}The men are terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.08,0:36:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得该把那个男人扔到冰面上\N{\rEng}They think that man should be surrendered to the ice
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.54,0:36:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,结束这一切\N{\rEng}and be done with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.33,0:37:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他受我保护…\N{\rEng}He is under my protection…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.45,0:37:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,受王国庇佑！\N{\rEng}and the protection of the Crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.83,0:37:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,几周后 我、威廉和哈兰德 骑马穿过海峡\N{\rEng}A few weeks later, I rode with William and Harlander
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.87,0:37:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,来到瓦杜兹附近的一个湖边\N{\rEng}to a lake near Vaduz across the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.54,0:37:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这座塔楼是用来过滤农田灌溉用水的\N{\rEng}The tower was built as a water filtration plant to irrigate the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.04,0:37:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是个公共工程项目 所以战争一开始就被弃建了\N{\rEng}Public works, so construction was abandoned at the start of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.08,0:37:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这场战争 是前一场\N{\rEng}Not this war, the one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.54,0:37:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是再前面一场 我记不清了\N{\rEng}Or the one before that, I cannot quite remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.50,0:37:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一看到它\N{\rEng}The moment I laid eyes on it…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.62,0:37:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这座塔楼\N{\rEng}The tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.37,0:37:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我便感受到了命运的召唤\N{\rEng}I could feel destiny calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.79,0:38:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,建筑结构基本完整\N{\rEng}The structure's basically intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.66,0:38:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还有一条陡坡道 从顶上直通到底部\N{\rEng}And there's a chute going from top, right to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.41,0:38:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我会安排人把你的个人物品\N{\rEng}I can arrange for your belongings.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.29,0:38:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,从爱丁堡运过来\N{\rEng}We'll bring them from Edinburgh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.95,0:38:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要什么 都能满足\N{\rEng}Anything you need or want shall be granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.54,0:38:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么都可以？ -什么都可以\N{\rEng}-Anything? -Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.83,0:38:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,整个项目期间 威廉随叫随到\N{\rEng}I have secured William's service for the duration of the project.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.45,0:38:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我要一个临时密室\N{\rEng}I'll need a holding cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.58,0:38:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-实验室旁边要有个冷库 -威廉\N{\rEng}-And an ice chamber close to the lab. -William.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.41,0:38:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,塔楼底部有两个泵水库\N{\rEng}There are two pump reservoirs at the base of the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.87,0:38:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要改造一下\N{\rEng}We'll repurpose those.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.37,0:38:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要重启蒸汽机\N{\rEng}We shall need to recondition the steam engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.37,0:38:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,需要足够的燃料 来保证机器正常运转\N{\rEng}We'll need enough fuel to make sure they run.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.75,0:39:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那里 还有那里 放四块高容量的伏打电池\N{\rEng}There and there, four high-capacity voltaic batteries,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.50,0:39:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,正负电极\N{\rEng}positive and negative polarity,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.25,0:39:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,还要一套纯银避雷针系统 向下延伸至实验室\N{\rEng}and a lightning rod system of pure silver telescoping down into the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.54,0:39:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 你需要什么设备 我的承包商都能造出来\N{\rEng}Yes. My contractors can manufacture any and all equipment you may require.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.50,0:39:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们应该达成共识了吧？\N{\rEng}I take it then that we have an understanding?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.20,0:39:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,交易达成\N{\rEng}A bargain has been struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.37,0:39:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋！\N{\rEng}Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.08,0:39:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这个不行\N{\rEng}No. No. Not this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.33,0:39:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,张嘴\N{\rEng}Aah. Open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.41,0:39:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,被绞死算你走运 你本就活不过今年了\N{\rEng}You, you're lucky to be hanged. You would have died within the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.62,0:39:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哈兰德先生答应我 让我拿到最好的样本\N{\rEng}Herr Harlander promised me access to optimal specimens.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.20,0:39:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,阁下 他倒是答应了\N{\rEng}Yeah, that he may have, your lordship,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.95,0:39:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,可您也知道\N{\rEng}but as you well know,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.37,0:40:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,犯罪又不是什么好差事 我们这里也只有些歪瓜裂枣\N{\rEng}crime doesn't pay, and it's a poor showing of it we have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.95,0:40:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个都是可怜虫\N{\rEng}They're wretches every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.79,0:40:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,真是抱歉\N{\rEng}I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.50,0:40:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,背很强壮 这个可以\N{\rEng}That's a strong back. This one will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.25,0:40:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,稍后再来\N{\rEng}Come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.37,0:40:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,来告解？\N{\rEng}Confession?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.12,0:40:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好奇\N{\rEng}I was intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.45,0:40:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如此纤弱又虔诚的人 能有什么要告解的？\N{\rEng}What would such a delicate, pious creature have to confess to?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.12,0:41:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真是碰巧 被我找到了一个机会\N{\rEng}As luck would have it, an opportunity presented itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.62,0:41:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\rEng}and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.95,0:41:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我就要揭开谜底了\N{\rEng}I was about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.87,0:41:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,神父 请为我祝福 我有罪\N{\rEng}Bless me, Father, for I have sinned.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.58,0:41:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子 你多久没告解了？\N{\rEng}How long has it been since your last confession, my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.33,0:41:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还没到一周 神父 我在修道院待过\N{\rEng}Barely a week, Father. I was in a convent.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.04,0:41:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就一周？\N{\rEng}A week?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.45,0:41:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你就这么轻率地犯错了？\N{\rEng}Tsk-tsk. Have you so hastily committed sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.66,0:41:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rEng}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.08,0:41:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是罪孽的念头 并非实际行动\N{\rEng}Sin of intent, not deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.62,0:41:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-因为一名男子 对不对？ -对\N{\rEng}-A man, is it? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.70,0:41:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是我未婚夫的兄长\N{\rEng}My fiancé's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.50,0:41:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是欲念吗？\N{\rEng}Lust?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.75,0:41:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是憎恶\N{\rEng}Hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.66,0:41:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,憎恶…\N{\rEng}Hatred…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.45,0:41:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-憎恶？ -那名男子很恶劣、很丑陋\N{\rEng}-Hatred? -The man is appalling, grotesque.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.79,0:41:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话很是刺耳\N{\rEng}Harsh words.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.37,0:42:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,近乎无情了 对吗？\N{\rEng}Rather uncharitable, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.08,0:42:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,尊敬的神父 您并不了解这个人\N{\rEng}Respectfully, Father, you do not know this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.62,0:42:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他试图操控周围一切的人和事\N{\rEng}He tries to control and manipulate everything and everyone around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.16,0:42:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他和所有暴君一样 以假扮受害者为乐\N{\rEng}Like every tyrant, he delights in playing the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.87,0:42:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说 那是他唯一的本事\N{\rEng}His only advantage, I would say,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.37,0:42:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他自以为绅士 实则粗鄙不堪\N{\rEng}is he's far cruder than he believes himself to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.87,0:42:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,粗鄙不堪？\N{\rEng}Cruder?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.70,0:42:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孩子 请详细说明\N{\rEng}Uh, pray explain yourself, my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.41,0:42:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,比如说 他太容易被发现了\N{\rEng}For one, he's easy to spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.00,0:42:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是集市日的拥挤街道上 也能轻松看到他\N{\rEng}You can see him… even on a busy street on market day.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.33,0:42:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧 你什么时候发现我的？\N{\rEng}Tell me, how soon did you spot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.12,0:42:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只能说远比你看到我来得早\N{\rEng}I saw you well before you saw me, I can say that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.12,0:42:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你吃过晚饭了吗？\N{\rEng}Have you had supper?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.25,0:42:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我还不怎么饿 男爵 谢谢\N{\rEng}I'm not that hungry, Baron. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.08,0:42:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我就饿坏了\N{\rEng}Well, I for one am famished.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.45,0:42:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-谢谢 好心人 -谢谢 先生\N{\rEng}-Thank you, my good man. -Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.62,0:42:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你买了什么书？能让我看看吗？\N{\rEng}What books did you buy, hmm? May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.12,0:42:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜\N{\rEng}Guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.79,0:42:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-让我猜？ -还是猜一下吧\N{\rEng}-Guess? -I'd rather that you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.37,0:42:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那好\N{\rEng}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.00,0:42:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,言情小说\N{\rEng}A romance…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.91,0:43:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,沐浴着地中海的阳光 身着丝绸华服 沉醉于爱的纠葛\N{\rEng}drenched in Mediterranean sun and silk and the skirmishes of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.25,0:43:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真是无礼 但也不奇怪\N{\rEng}Insulting, but unsurprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.79,0:43:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\rEng}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.04,0:43:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,昆虫？\N{\rEng}-Insects? -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.66,0:43:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我对科学的兴趣 体现在对微小生物的好奇上\N{\rEng}My interest in science leans towards the smallest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.20,0:43:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,它们随自然而动 或许是顺应上帝的节律\N{\rEng}Moving with nature, perhaps the rhythms of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.20,0:43:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在寻觅 某种更纯粹、更奇妙的事物\N{\rEng}I've always searched for something more pure, marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.00,0:43:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你在修道院追寻的东西吗？\N{\rEng}Is that what you were seeking in the convent?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.91,0:43:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\rEng}In a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.12,0:43:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,值得吗？\N{\rEng}Was it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.95,0:43:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么是值得的吗？\N{\rEng}Is anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.12,0:43:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗？\N{\rEng}Permit me, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.20,0:44:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这样好像不大合适\N{\rEng}This hardly seems appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.20,0:44:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么是合适的吗？\N{\rEng}Is anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.83,0:44:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\rEng}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.37,0:44:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,笑起来！\N{\rEng}Laughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.00,0:44:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,生平第一次\N{\rEng}And for the very first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.50,0:44:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不知何故 我对生的兴趣渐浓\N{\rEng}I became more interested in life
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.20,0:44:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对死的兴趣\N{\rEng}and somewhat less interested
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.04,0:44:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,减淡了\N{\rEng} in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.87,0:44:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,主杆采用快速螺栓固定系统\N{\rEng}The main rod has a fast bolting system.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.00,0:44:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,用合金了吗？\N{\rEng}Did you use an alloy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.33,0:44:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,铜锌合金\N{\rEng}Copper and zinc.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.95,0:45:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这个不行 重来吧\N{\rEng}This is… This simply will not do. Start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.54,0:45:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,纯银是完美的导体\N{\rEng}Pure silver is a perfect conductor.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.91,0:45:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉 你得留下 拜托了\N{\rEng}William, you must stay behind. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.20,0:45:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我最信任的就是你了\N{\rEng}I trust you above anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.20,0:45:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,再多待几天就行\N{\rEng}Only for a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.25,0:45:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你抓不到它的\N{\rEng}You're not going to catch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.83,0:45:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真漂亮\N{\rEng}Beautiful. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.58,0:45:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,把它关起来 还是放走呢？\N{\rEng}-Should we trap her or let her go? -Mm…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.91,0:45:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,关起来\N{\rEng}Trap her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.37,0:45:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这下我们有共同点了\N{\rEng}Now we have something in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.79,0:45:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,一个囚徒\N{\rEng}A prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.29,0:45:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉如约行事 认真负责建造实验室 满足各种需求\N{\rEng}As promised, William took dutiful charge of the laboratory build and needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.37,0:45:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那边能修一下吗？\N{\rEng}Can you fix that over there, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.50,0:45:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,去帮一下\N{\rEng}Go, help.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.45,0:45:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他严格按我的指示办事\N{\rEng}He followed my instructions to the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.66,0:45:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,电池\N{\rEng}The battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.58,0:46:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是纯银的了\N{\rEng}It's all pure silver now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.70,0:46:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这是和淋巴系统相对应的传导点\N{\rEng}Conduction points corresponding to the lymphatic system,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.25,0:46:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,非常复杂 但我做出来了\N{\rEng}which was quite complex. -But I managed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.33,0:46:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\rEng}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.79,0:47:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哈兰德先生 谢谢 派对很精彩\N{\rEng}Herr Harlander, thank you. The party's delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.08,0:47:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿我们没有干扰你做研究\N{\rEng}I hope we're not distracting you from your research
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.62,0:47:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟你还要顾着我和伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}to tend to me and Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.54,0:47:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有\N{\rEng}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.62,0:47:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她还年轻 我们得护着她\N{\rEng}She's young. She can count on us to guard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.75,0:47:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是回避一下\N{\rEng}I shall leave you your privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.54,0:47:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间还掩饰什么\N{\rEng}No need for subterfuge between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.29,0:47:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,法国陶瓷 多么美妙的共响\N{\rEng}French porcelain, chimes to a man's stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.12,0:47:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我快找到解决方法了 给淋巴系统确定传导点\N{\rEng}I am very near a solution, an access point to the lymphatic system.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.45,0:47:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那个呀\N{\rEng}Ah, yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.00,0:47:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这么久了\N{\rEng}It's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.41,0:47:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,仗快打完了\N{\rEng}The war is waning.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.04,0:47:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,资金供应也快断了\N{\rEng}And my funding will end with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.25,0:47:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说资金无限供应吗？\N{\rEng}You said your funds were unlimited.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.79,0:47:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但我的耐心是有限的\N{\rEng}My patience is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.04,0:47:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我得到了可靠消息 一周内会爆发一场战斗\N{\rEng}I have it on good authority that a battle is to take place within a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.79,0:48:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,战争好比潮水 会把战利品送到我们这条海岸上来\N{\rEng}The tide of war will deliver its bounty to our shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.04,0:48:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,战场上的尸体肯定一塌糊涂\N{\rEng}A battlefield? The bodies will be mangled.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.29,0:48:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就一周\N{\rEng}One week.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.12,0:48:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-一周？ -一周后 创造历史的机会就会溜走\N{\rEng}-One week? -After that, history will pass us by.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.66,0:48:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我冲一下吧 男爵\N{\rEng}Flush that for me, will you, Baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.58,0:48:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一周内找到传递电流的办法\N{\rEng}A week to determine how to deliver the current.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.45,0:48:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,绝无可能\N{\rEng}Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.58,0:48:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办？\N{\rEng}What would I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.91,0:48:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就快成功了 我感觉得到\N{\rEng}I was close. I could feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.58,0:48:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知横生阻碍\N{\rEng}And then…life got in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.58,0:48:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\rEng}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.45,0:48:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,它肯定想你了\N{\rEng}I believe she missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.25,0:48:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白 我得先警告你一下 我在处理解剖体\N{\rEng}I must warn you, Elizabeth, I've been working on a dissection.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.00,0:48:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很美\N{\rEng}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.83,0:48:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,吓到你了吗？\N{\rEng}Does it shock you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.87,0:48:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,让我想起了殉道主题的绘画\N{\rEng}Reminds me of martyrdom paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.70,0:48:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没有了痛苦\N{\rEng}Pain is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.20,0:48:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在对称的构造和形状中 看得到上帝的精妙手笔\N{\rEng}You can see God's design in the symmetry and the shapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.79,0:48:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.79,0:49:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我得向你坦白\N{\rEng}I must confess something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.50,0:49:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信这世间存在奇妙非凡之物 你也一样\N{\rEng}I have a belief in the marvelous and so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.62,0:49:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间有种默契 你能感觉到吗？\N{\rEng}There is a bond between us. Can you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.12,0:49:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一种近乎生理上的吸引 我坚信这种感觉绝非寻常\N{\rEng}An almost physical one. I truly believe it to be something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.04,0:49:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你所信之物 未必是事实\N{\rEng}Believing something does not make it true.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.37,0:49:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为什么来这里？\N{\rEng}Then why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.16,0:49:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,它很美 对不对？\N{\rEng}Beautiful creature, is she not?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.08,0:49:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,孤傲 令人沉迷 却又如此怪异\N{\rEng}Remote. Entirely bewitching, but so odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.08,0:49:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有三颗心\N{\rEng}Three hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.12,0:49:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,复眼 白色的血\N{\rEng}Multiple eyes. White blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.00,0:50:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,它无法做出选择 所以如此迷人\N{\rEng}And a fascinating lack of choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.95,0:50:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\rEng}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.45,0:50:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,有选择的能力 灵魂才能栖息\N{\rEng}Choice is the seat of the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.04,0:50:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是上帝对我们的赠礼\N{\rEng}The one gift God granted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.12,0:50:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}Elizabeth…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.54,0:50:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我做出选择了\N{\rEng}I have chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.04,0:50:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\rEng}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.79,0:50:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白！\N{\rEng}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.04,0:50:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白！\N{\rEng}Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.41,0:50:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我失败了\N{\rEng}I thought I had failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.25,0:50:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,以为一切都完了 以为…\N{\rEng}I thought it was entirely over. I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.95,0:50:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为…\N{\rEng}And I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.16,0:50:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\rEng}And I…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.95,0:50:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对称性\N{\rEng}The symmetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.62,0:51:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝创造的对称性 对\N{\rEng}God's symmetry. Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.12,0:51:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.25,0:51:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,把电池放在淋巴系统上\N{\rEng}Placing the battery above the lymphatic system.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.16,0:51:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我就这么找到了解题的关键\N{\rEng}I had found the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.66,0:51:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,再也没有什么能阻挡我了\N{\rEng}Nothing could stop me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.62,0:51:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\rEng}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.41,0:51:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别动！这堆尸体\N{\rEng}No! No, do not take any bodies
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.62,0:51:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,顶上的和底部的都别搬 就搬我做了标记的\N{\rEng}from the top or the bottom of the pile unless I mark them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.87,0:51:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,冰冻或腐败可能会破坏组织\N{\rEng}Ice or rot may have destroyed the tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.95,0:51:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就看中间的那些\N{\rEng}Look only in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.75,0:52:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,东西太多 会让人晕头转向 除非目标非常明确\N{\rEng}Abundance can be disorienting unless one hones one's aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.70,0:52:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要个子高的 长手长脚的\N{\rEng}I'm favoring tall specimens, long limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.54,0:52:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,划定范围 活就好干了\N{\rEng}Scale will make the work easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.37,0:52:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\rEng}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.33,0:52:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,尽善尽美嘛\N{\rEng}Perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.37,0:52:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么不好呢 亲爱的男爵？\N{\rEng}And why not, dear Baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.79,0:52:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,确实 有什么不好呢？\N{\rEng}Indeed, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.83,0:52:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,找到完整的人头\N{\rEng}Look for a head that's intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.79,0:52:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,搬到车上去\N{\rEng}Put that one in the cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.16,0:52:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那个放那边\N{\rEng}Set that one over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.87,0:52:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的送过来\N{\rEng}Bring the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.95,0:52:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\rEng}Oh, good God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.79,0:53:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,劳驾\N{\rEng}Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.25,0:55:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,大功告成\N{\rEng}It is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.62,0:56:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哈兰德先生！\N{\rEng}Herr Harlander!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.91,0:56:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,暴风雨要来了！\N{\rEng}A storm is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.04,0:56:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的拐杖\N{\rEng}My cane.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.37,0:56:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我的拐杖！\N{\rEng}My cane!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.79,0:56:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我的拐杖 手柄打开\N{\rEng}My cane, in the handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.79,0:56:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,水银\N{\rEng}Mercury.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.79,0:56:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-你病了吗？ -谢谢\N{\rEng}-Are you ill? -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.54,0:56:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是梅毒吗？\N{\rEng}Is it… syphilis?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.37,0:56:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我快死了\N{\rEng}Yeah, I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.70,0:56:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一夜偷欢 终生服毒\N{\rEng}One night with Venus, a lifetime with Mercury.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.79,0:56:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是这么说的吧？\N{\rEng}Isn't that the phrase?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.66,0:56:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,几期了？\N{\rEng}What stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.79,0:56:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,二期？\N{\rEng}Secondary?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.70,0:56:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你我都清楚会怎么发展\N{\rEng}We both know the precise schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.33,0:57:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,已经在啃噬我的骨头了\N{\rEng}It starts to eat away my bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.70,0:57:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,眼眶、脸颊、牙齿、下颌、颅骨 层层侵蚀 直到抵达大脑\N{\rEng}orbital, cheek, teeth, jaw, skull, exposing my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.41,0:57:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,长瘤、发狂、剧痛\N{\rEng}Tumors, madness, excruciating pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.37,0:57:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,到某个清晨 我会开始尖叫 停不下来\N{\rEng}One fine morning, I will start to scream and I will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.83,0:57:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法接受如此不堪地死去\N{\rEng}I cannot face such a vulgar demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.45,0:57:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我想到了我唯一的要求\N{\rEng}Which brings me to my one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.25,0:57:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们约定好的交易\N{\rEng}Our deal. As agreed, in exchange
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.29,0:57:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你慷慨解囊所能换取的东西\N{\rEng}for my generous intervention on your behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.45,0:57:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,既然我们即将造出新人类\N{\rEng}And as we give life to our new Adam,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.37,0:57:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要拥有这具完美新身体\N{\rEng}I want to be placed in this new perfect body.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.37,0:57:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.41,0:57:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-不可以 -当然可以\N{\rEng}-No, no. -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.04,0:57:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,还没到时候！\N{\rEng}Not now. Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.00,0:57:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-正是这时候 -这事我们以后再聊 现在不行\N{\rEng}-Precisely now. -We'll talk about this after, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.00,0:57:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哪还有什么以后！\N{\rEng}There is no after!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.83,0:57:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有以后了\N{\rEng}There is no after.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.04,0:58:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你要的一切 我都给你了！\N{\rEng}I gave you everything you wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.12,0:58:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你要什么 我都给你\N{\rEng}I give you everything you ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.37,0:58:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,随你说\N{\rEng}Name it, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.87,0:58:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你要伊丽莎白都行\N{\rEng}Even Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.04,0:58:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.20,0:58:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,礼貌一点总有效果\N{\rEng}"Please" always helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.75,0:58:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经病入膏肓了\N{\rEng}The disease has spread all inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.54,0:58:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这是全身性疾病 你知道的\N{\rEng}It's systemic, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.75,0:59:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你的每个器官都感染了\N{\rEng}Every organ in you is polluted.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.79,0:59:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大脑 血液 全都感染了\N{\rEng}Your brain, your blood, it's all polluted.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.95,0:59:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还有钱啊 对不对？\N{\rEng}But my money's not, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.58,0:59:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,无济于事\N{\rEng}It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.41,0:59:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我只要你说一个“行”字\N{\rEng}Now, all you need to say is one simple word.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.79,0:59:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别的什么都不要说\N{\rEng}"Yes," no more and no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.62,0:59:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不行！听明白了吗？不行！\N{\rEng}No! Do you understand? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.20,0:59:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\rEng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.83,0:59:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\rEng}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.50,0:59:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\rEng}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.58,0:59:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没了这个 我们就一无所有了 我们俩都会完蛋\N{\rEng}If we lose that, we have nothing. We both lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.04,0:59:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,普罗米修斯 我就是啄食你肝脏的鹰！\N{\rEng}I will be the eagle that feasts on your liver!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.83,0:59:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 住手！\N{\rEng}Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.41,0:59:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哈兰德先生！\N{\rEng}Herr Harlander. Herr Harlander!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.04,0:59:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 看着我！\N{\rEng}Hold on, look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.20,0:59:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不！哈兰德先生\N{\rEng}No! Herr Harlander!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.70,1:00:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊\N{\rEng}No, no. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.75,1:02:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\rEng}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.70,1:02:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.37,1:02:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\rEng}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.58,1:02:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗了我\N{\rEng}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.33,1:02:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,骗了我\N{\rEng}You lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.33,1:02:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.75,1:02:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.41,1:03:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别过来 求你了\N{\rEng}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.12,1:04:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看 一样的\N{\rEng}Look. Same.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.08,1:04:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳\N{\rEng}Sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.08,1:04:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,阳光\N{\rEng}Sun. Light.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.33,1:04:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,去感受一下\N{\rEng}Face it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.04,1:04:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,阳光 太阳…\N{\rEng}Sunlight. The sun is…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.33,1:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳是生命之源\N{\rEng}The sun is life.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.41,1:04:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,很温暖\N{\rEng}Ah, the warmth. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.54,1:04:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Yes! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.70,1:04:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.87,1:04:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.70,1:04:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-维克多 -对\N{\rEng}-Victor. -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.08,1:04:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你就是\N{\rEng}Yes, yes, yes. Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.37,1:04:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你当然就是\N{\rEng}Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.00,1:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.50,1:05:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,邮件来了\N{\rEng}The mail, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.04,1:05:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,老庄园来的信\N{\rEng}Letters from the old estate.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.00,1:05:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,日内瓦\N{\rEng}Geneva.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.83,1:05:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-有我叔叔的来信吗？ -没有\N{\rEng}-Is there anything from my uncle? -No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.16,1:05:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我们该去拜访一下他们了\N{\rEng}Perhaps we should pay them a visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.37,1:05:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 看着脚下\N{\rEng}Careful. Look. Look down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.33,1:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,水\N{\rEng}Water. Water.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.91,1:05:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,水\N{\rEng}Water.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.95,1:05:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对 水\N{\rEng}Yes, water.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.75,1:05:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-维克多 -不 我是维克多\N{\rEng}-Victor. -No, I'm Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.16,1:05:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是水 来这里\N{\rEng}That's water. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.58,1:05:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-维克多 -来吧 很好\N{\rEng}-Victor. -Come now, come. All right, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.41,1:05:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要跨一大步\N{\rEng}We're going to take a big step.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.16,1:05:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起来 准备好了？\N{\rEng}We'll do it together. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.50,1:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-走这边 这样 -维克多\N{\rEng}This way, like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.83,1:05:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那样 走这边\N{\rEng}No, not like that. This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.66,1:05:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰 烫\N{\rEng}Oh, no, no, no. Hot, hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.75,1:05:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不能碰 别碰它\N{\rEng}No, don't touch. Don't touch that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.33,1:05:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,烫\N{\rEng}It's hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.16,1:06:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下 很好 真棒\N{\rEng}Sit. Very good. Very good. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.66,1:06:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好 看这是什么\N{\rEng}Yes. Now, look what I have here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.00,1:06:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看这个 这是什么？\N{\rEng}Look at this. What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.83,1:06:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这个怪东西是什么？当心\N{\rEng}What is this strange thing? Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.33,1:06:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你力气很大\N{\rEng}You're very strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.37,1:06:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 这样\N{\rEng}Yes. And like this. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.50,1:06:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还想要那个？好 这个放这里\N{\rEng}Yes, you want another? Yes, this one goes right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.29,1:06:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\rEng}Key.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.29,1:06:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.33,1:06:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你就不会着凉了\N{\rEng}This will keep you nice and warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.29,1:06:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,披上一条好毯子 暖暖的\N{\rEng}Nice blanket to keep you warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.54,1:06:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}-Victor. 
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.16,1:06:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.54,1:06:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你待在这里\N{\rEng}You stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.37,1:06:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,就待在这里\N{\rEng}You stay here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.54,1:06:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,待着别动\N{\rEng}Stay here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.75,1:06:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我去去就回 待着别动\N{\rEng}I'll be back. All right. Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.33,1:06:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.45,1:06:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别动 没事的\N{\rEng}No, no, no, no, no. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.08,1:06:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\rEng}I'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.00,1:07:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.50,1:07:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.45,1:07:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,对他来说 一切都是新的\N{\rEng}Everything was new to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.50,1:07:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,温暖、冰冷、阳光、黑暗\N{\rEng}Warmth, cold, light, darkness.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.54,1:07:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我的任务是塑造他\N{\rEng}And I was there to mold him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.08,1:07:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,造成之后的事 我还从未考虑过\N{\rEng}I never considered what would come after creation.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.70,1:07:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来到世界尽头\N{\rEng}And having reached the edge of the earth,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.12,1:07:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,才发现没有地平线\N{\rEng}there was no horizon left.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.45,1:07:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如此成就有种非自然的感觉\N{\rEng}The achievement felt unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.79,1:07:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,并无意义\N{\rEng}Void of meaning.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.58,1:07:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我十分烦恼\N{\rEng}And this troubled me so.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.66,1:07:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,船员们都想回去\N{\rEng}Your men, they wish to go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.00,1:07:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗？\N{\rEng}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.45,1:07:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\rEng}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.70,1:07:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不过一旦船能开动 我们就会继续前行\N{\rEng}But the moment we're free, we're setting sails forwards.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.16,1:07:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不管付出什么代价\N{\rEng}No matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.54,1:08:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你简直和我一样疯狂\N{\rEng}You share my madness.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.91,1:08:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你讲述自己的故事 或许别有深意\N{\rEng}Perhaps there is a finer point in me telling you my story.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.25,1:08:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,男爵 不管是否如此\N{\rEng}Whether there is or isn't, Baron…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.12,1:08:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我都愿意听\N{\rEng}I'd like to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.45,1:08:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,几周过去了\N{\rEng}Weeks passed,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.37,1:08:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他的力量迅速增强 我却日渐衰弱\N{\rEng}and as his strength increased rapidly, mine waned.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.70,1:08:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜他没学会更多的话 也没有别的进展\N{\rEng}Alas, no further language or development occurred.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.12,1:08:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不对\N{\rEng}No, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.83,1:08:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,低头\N{\rEng}Down, down, down, down.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.62,1:08:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\rEng}Yes, there we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.04,1:08:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了 别动\N{\rEng}There we are. Stay there. Stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.20,1:08:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你\N{\rEng}Yes, that's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.91,1:08:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你 知道了吗？\N{\rEng}That's you. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.70,1:08:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,愈合得很好\N{\rEng}Oh, yes, this is healing rather nicely.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.66,1:08:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我累了\N{\rEng}I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.87,1:08:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我好久没睡了\N{\rEng}I have not slept.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.83,1:09:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一点都没睡\N{\rEng}Not a winky-dinky-doo of sleep for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.50,1:09:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在照顾你\N{\rEng}Tending to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.91,1:09:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,终于给你脸上刮干净了\N{\rEng}I've finished shaving you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.66,1:09:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 别动\N{\rEng}No, no, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.58,1:09:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,放下 不可以 松开\N{\rEng}Let go. No, no, no, no, no, no. Open.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.00,1:09:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,手松开 快松开\N{\rEng}Open your hand. Open. Open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.12,1:09:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？\N{\rEng}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.16,1:09:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你都干了什么\N{\rEng}Look. Look what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.75,1:09:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你要听我的话 我说了放下\N{\rEng}You have to listen to me. You have to listen. I said drop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.50,1:09:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真蠢！不 别这样\N{\rEng}Stupidity! No. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.25,1:09:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\rEng}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.16,1:09:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-维克多 -不 别碰我！\N{\rEng}-Victor. -No, don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.66,1:09:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,永远都别碰我！\N{\rEng}Don't ever touch me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.12,1:09:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\rEng}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.16,1:09:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我 是你自己弄的\N{\rEng}I didn't do this. You did this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.20,1:09:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,伤口\N{\rEng}The wound.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.54,1:09:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,闭合了\N{\rEng}It's closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.25,1:09:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会的\N{\rEng}But how?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.75,1:10:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.16,1:10:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\rEng}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.66,1:10:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.62,1:10:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.20,1:10:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rEng}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.66,1:10:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定一切都好\N{\rEng}I'm sure everything's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.08,1:10:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就到了\N{\rEng}We'll be there soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.87,1:10:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你有想法 我知道\N{\rEng}I know you have thoughts. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.87,1:10:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你有\N{\rEng}I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.12,1:10:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这里面 你有想法\N{\rEng}Somewhere in there. Somewhere in there you have thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.79,1:10:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是？\N{\rEng}Hmm? Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.45,1:10:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么吗？\N{\rEng}Something you might want to say?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.87,1:10:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然脑子里很乱、很困惑\N{\rEng}However jumbled, however confused?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.79,1:10:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有想法吗？\N{\rEng}Hmm? Something?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.41,1:10:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还是我太心急了？\N{\rEng}Am I presuming too much?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.62,1:10:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.75,1:10:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了！\N{\rEng}Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.87,1:10:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这个已经教会你了\N{\rEng}This much we have established.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.83,1:10:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的名字 我的名字是维克多\N{\rEng}That is my name. My name is Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.12,1:10:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能说点别的吗？什么都可以\N{\rEng}Is there anything else that you can say? Anything at all? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.70,1:11:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗？\N{\rEng}Anything? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.83,1:11:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳\N{\rEng}Um, sun, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.79,1:11:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,冷、雨、血 任何东西\N{\rEng}Cold. Rain. Blood. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.00,1:11:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,靴子 靴子会说吗？\N{\rEng}Boot. Can you say "boot"?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.70,1:11:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.25,1:11:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,够了！那么…\N{\rEng}No, yes, no, yes! How about…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.25,1:11:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,手呢？手会说吗？\N{\rEng}How about "hand"? Can you say "hand"?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.04,1:11:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,手 说啊…\N{\rEng}Hand. Hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.87,1:11:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是怕我吗？\N{\rEng}Oh. Oh, oh. You are afraid of me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.62,1:11:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你怕我？\N{\rEng}You're afraid of me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.33,1:11:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？为什么你会怕我？\N{\rEng}Why? Why would you be afraid of me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.66,1:11:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你的\N{\rEng}I'm not going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.70,1:11:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你的 是我造了你\N{\rEng}I'm not going to hurt you. I made you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.00,1:11:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是我造了你！别这样了！\N{\rEng}I'm your maker! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.45,1:11:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们来了 真的来了\N{\rEng}You're here. You're really here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.16,1:12:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 快进来\N{\rEng}Come on, then. Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.41,1:12:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白 我得说 我有好多东西要给你看\N{\rEng}I have to tell you. I have so much to show you, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.00,1:12:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,特别奇妙 你都不敢相信\N{\rEng}You won't believe it. It's absolutely marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.00,1:12:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快来 先给你看我的笔记\N{\rEng}Come, come, I'll show you my notes first.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.75,1:12:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我叔叔在这里吗？\N{\rEng}Is my uncle here?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.00,1:12:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.66,1:12:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我叔叔 他在这里吗？\N{\rEng}My uncle, is he here?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.95,1:12:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不在\N{\rEng}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.37,1:12:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就我一个人 他不在\N{\rEng}No, I'm alone. He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.16,1:12:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-他…他几天后会回来 -维克多 你看着状态不大好\N{\rEng}-He's… He'll be back in a few days. -You don't look very well, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.08,1:12:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的状态从来没这么好过！ 我的头脑清晰多了！快来！\N{\rEng}Oh, I've never felt better! I've never had a clearer mind! Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.33,1:12:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你发烧了吗？\N{\rEng}Are you running a fever?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.33,1:12:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是看到你太激动了\N{\rEng}I am just very excited to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.62,1:12:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我太高兴了 简直要飞起来了\N{\rEng}I'm exalted. The spirits have lifted me so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.08,1:12:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西太神奇了 我就知道能实现\N{\rEng}Absolutely marvelous…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.79,1:12:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.33,1:12:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多 请给我一点时间\N{\rEng}Victor. Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.50,1:14:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁伤害了你？\N{\rEng}Who hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.75,1:14:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉 你一定要看看这个\N{\rEng}I have to show you this, William.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.54,1:15:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我先整理一下\N{\rEng}Let me organize it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.12,1:15:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有东西要给你看\N{\rEng}And I have something to show to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.04,1:15:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟英国皇家医学会的人聊过了\N{\rEng}I've spoken to the Royal Medical Society.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.70,1:15:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们想见你 -现在还不行\N{\rEng}-They're interested in seeing you. -No, no, no, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.83,1:15:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没准备好\N{\rEng}I'm not quite ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.33,1:15:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为这是你一直以来的梦想\N{\rEng}I thought that's what you always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.41,1:15:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那个男人\N{\rEng}The man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.50,1:15:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-楼下的那个男人 -你看到他了？\N{\rEng}-The man downstairs. -You saw him?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.91,1:15:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他是病人吗？是被你打伤的吗？\N{\rEng}Is he a patient? A victim?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.08,1:15:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他身上好多伤口 你竟然下手那么重\N{\rEng}His wounds. You wounded him like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.29,1:15:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不 伤害他的是这个世界 伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}No, no, no. It was the world that hurt him, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.08,1:15:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我给了他生命\N{\rEng}I… I gave him life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.41,1:15:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我给了他生命\N{\rEng}I gave him life.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.00,1:15:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,起来\N{\rEng}Up, up, up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.87,1:15:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.83,1:15:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着\N{\rEng}There, there, there…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.33,1:15:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他还在适应周围的环境\N{\rEng}He's still getting used to his surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.12,1:15:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,它很强壮 威廉\N{\rEng}It is strong, William.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.25,1:15:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-你成功了 -非常强壮\N{\rEng}-You did it. -It's so strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.79,1:15:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你成功了\N{\rEng}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.33,1:15:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,体内所有系统都正常运作\N{\rEng}All its systems are functional.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.37,1:16:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,伤口都在愈合\N{\rEng}All healing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.79,1:16:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,愈合的状态不稳定\N{\rEng}And the healing is erratic, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.08,1:16:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但是非同寻常\N{\rEng}But exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.41,1:16:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么被拴在这里？\N{\rEng}Why is he chained here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.20,1:16:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保护他自己 还有我\N{\rEng}For his own safety and for mine,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.95,1:16:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,也更方便给它清洁维护\N{\rEng}and it's easy to clean and, uh, maintain it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.70,1:16:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,很多事它还不懂\N{\rEng}And it doesn't know any better.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.50,1:16:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但你懂\N{\rEng}But you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.70,1:16:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哈兰德知道了吗？\N{\rEng}Does Harlander know?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.37,1:16:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要在他回来之前把一切准备好…\N{\rEng}We have to prepare everything for the moment he returns.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.08,1:16:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-当然 -…让一切都有模有样\N{\rEng}-Of course. -And have everything presentable.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.75,1:16:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,它有智慧吗？\N{\rEng}Is it intelligent?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.37,1:16:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多 它有智慧吗？\N{\rEng}Victor, is it intelligent?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.62,1:17:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我无法理解你是怎么做到的\N{\rEng}I can't fathom how exactly you did what you did,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.83,1:17:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但这无疑是一项壮举\N{\rEng}but its dimension does not escape me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.29,1:17:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多 你有没有问过自己\N{\rEng}Victor, did you ever ask yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.04,1:17:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人的所有组成部分中\N{\rEng}of all the parts that make that man,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.83,1:17:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哪块是灵魂藏身的地方？\N{\rEng}which one holds the soul?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.45,1:17:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我没问过\N{\rEng}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.58,1:17:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,楼下那头怪物总让人感到不安\N{\rEng}There's something so disquieting about that creature down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.20,1:17:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,扭曲诡异 像个在哈哈镜里探头探脑的身影\N{\rEng}Askew, like a figure peeking around a funhouse mirror.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.20,1:17:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但很有活力\N{\rEng}But animated.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.29,1:17:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是哪里来的活力？\N{\rEng}Animated by what?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.33,1:18:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,痛吗？\N{\rEng}Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.50,1:18:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,叶子？\N{\rEng}A leaf?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.95,1:18:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,给我的吗？\N{\rEng}For me?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.83,1:18:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.04,1:19:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很美？\N{\rEng}Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.87,1:19:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,给我的吗？\N{\rEng}This is for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.58,1:19:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我是伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}I'm Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.62,1:19:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,会说吗？伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}Can you say "Elizabeth"?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.29,1:19:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.62,1:19:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,从喉咙里发出声音\N{\rEng}My throat makes sounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.75,1:19:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.75,1:19:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\rEng}I'm going to go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.75,1:19:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎…白\N{\rEng}Eliza… beth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.83,1:20:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该靠近那东西的\N{\rEng}You should not go near it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.66,1:20:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西？\N{\rEng}"It"?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.66,1:20:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 那东西\N{\rEng}It. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.25,1:20:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西是活的 但没有智慧的火花\N{\rEng}I believe there is life in it, but not the spark of intelligence 
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.45,1:20:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我故意这么设计的\N{\rEng}that I had intended.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.54,1:20:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可能不是你想象的那样\N{\rEng}Perhaps not as you understand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.25,1:20:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,什么地方出了差错\N{\rEng}Something went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.95,1:20:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,阻塞了 缝合了 连通了\N{\rEng}A blockage, a suture, a connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.45,1:20:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的维克多·弗兰肯斯坦 还会犯错？\N{\rEng}You, the great Victor Frankenstein, you made a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.04,1:20:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那头怪物只会一个词 仅有的一个\N{\rEng}The Creature knows but one word, and one word alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.33,1:20:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}"Victor, Victor, Victor, Victor."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.37,1:20:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只是莫名其妙地机械重复\N{\rEng}It just parrots it without rhyme or reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.95,1:20:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,也许在当下 那个词就是他的一切\N{\rEng}Perhaps for the time being that word means everything to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.04,1:20:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要是重生后的他 获得活力的源泉其实更简单\N{\rEng}What if in being anew, the spirit that animates him is simpler,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.45,1:20:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-更纯粹… -纯粹？\N{\rEng}-purer-- -Purer?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.66,1:20:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,比普通人的更纯粹呢？\N{\rEng}Purer than that of the common man?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.29,1:20:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,要是他不受制于原罪\N{\rEng}What if, unrestrained by sin,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.04,1:20:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,而造物主为这具伤痕累累的血肉之躯 直接注入了生气呢？\N{\rEng}our creator's breath came into its wounded flesh directly?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.95,1:20:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}Good God, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.91,1:20:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我强迫自己信了你这话\N{\rEng}If I could force myself to believe it,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.12,1:20:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我会觉得你是不是被这东西吸引了\N{\rEng}it would be my inclination to see attraction in you for that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.25,1:20:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好好理解一下\N{\rEng}Understanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.62,1:21:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他的眼中有痛苦的情绪\N{\rEng}In those eyes I saw pain,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.00,1:21:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,没有智慧 何来痛苦？\N{\rEng}and what is pain if not evidence of intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.12,1:21:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那我的痛苦算什么？\N{\rEng}What about my pain?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.91,1:21:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,被你拒绝算什么？\N{\rEng}What about what you have denied me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.91,1:21:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心想要什么？\N{\rEng}What my heart wants…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.87,1:21:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你的心？\N{\rEng}Your heart?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.33,1:21:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人体结构中\N{\rEng}Of all the human anatomy,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.75,1:21:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,只有心最难捉摸\N{\rEng}that is the organ furthest from your understanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.33,1:21:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,男爵 只有怪物会扮演上帝\N{\rEng}Only monsters play God, Baron.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.25,1:21:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,比普通人更纯粹\N{\rEng}Purer than the common man, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.54,1:21:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不知怎的 我成了坏人\N{\rEng}And I, somehow, the villain. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.87,1:21:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你的心很纯粹？\N{\rEng}Your heart is pure?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.37,1:21:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证 并非如此\N{\rEng}I assure you it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.41,1:21:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 因为是我亲手放进去的\N{\rEng}I should know. I put it there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.62,1:21:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,上去\N{\rEng}Up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.79,1:22:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,再试一下\N{\rEng}Let us try again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.20,1:22:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,腿伸出来\N{\rEng}Now give me your leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.16,1:22:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,腿！\N{\rEng}Leg!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.50,1:22:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,腿伸出来！\N{\rEng}Give me your leg!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.37,1:22:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没有智慧 何来痛苦？\N{\rEng}Pain is evidence of intelligence, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.33,1:22:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,行 测试一下这个说法吧\N{\rEng}Well, let's test the theory.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.62,1:22:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,腿伸出来！\N{\rEng}Give me your leg!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.20,1:22:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,腿！\N{\rEng}Leg!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.08,1:22:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,腿！\N{\rEng}Leg!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.08,1:22:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\rEng}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.95,1:22:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,伸出来 你个野兽！\N{\rEng}Give it to me, you beast!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.83,1:22:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,腿伸出来！\N{\rEng}Give me your leg!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.04,1:22:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,腿！\N{\rEng}Leg!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.62,1:22:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.25,1:22:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.37,1:22:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.29,1:22:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor! Victor!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.91,1:22:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多 怎么了？\N{\rEng}What is it, Victor?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.29,1:22:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\rEng}Come. Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.54,1:22:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我失败了 我犯了大错\N{\rEng}I failed. I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.66,1:22:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-你没有失败 我看过你的图纸了 -失败了\N{\rEng}-No, you didn't fail. I saw your papers. -I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.75,1:22:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-非常完美 -那头怪物极其危险\N{\rEng}-It's perfect. -The Creature is extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.87,1:23:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没有…维克多\N{\rEng}There's not… Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.12,1:23:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们等哈兰德回来 再一起讨论吧\N{\rEng}Let's wait for Harlander and discuss together.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.20,1:23:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,威廉 有件事我得告诉你\N{\rEng}William, there is something you should know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.33,1:23:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我得给你看一下\N{\rEng}Something I have to show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.54,1:23:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-哈兰德… -那头怪物突然暴怒 把他杀了\N{\rEng}-Ha-- Harlander… -In a fit of rage, he killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.70,1:23:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这下你知道 我为什么没有及时告诉你了吧？\N{\rEng}Do you understand now why I was hesitant to share this with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.50,1:23:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,当然也不敢让伊丽莎白知道\N{\rEng}And certainly not with Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.83,1:23:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在怎么办？\N{\rEng}S… So what's to be done now?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.12,1:23:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.04,1:23:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-现在怎么办？ -你说怎么办？\N{\rEng}-What's to be done? -"What's to be done"?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.75,1:23:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你得带伊丽莎白回维也纳\N{\rEng}You must take Elizabeth back to Vienna.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.54,1:23:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就说出了急事 必须马上走\N{\rEng}Tell her something urgent came up and you have to leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.87,1:23:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别让她知道\N{\rEng}Keep her in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.54,1:23:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了保护她\N{\rEng}For her own safety.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.16,1:23:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,必须照我说的办\N{\rEng}You have to do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.66,1:23:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很快就回来 但现在只能先走\N{\rEng}We'll be back in no time. But for now, this is for the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.70,1:23:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,请上马车吧\N{\rEng}Now get in the carriage, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.79,1:24:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得那头怪物能活多久？\N{\rEng}The Creature, what's its lifespan, you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.91,1:24:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,必然没多久\N{\rEng}Brief. Very brief, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.37,1:25:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我有种很坏的预感\N{\rEng}I have the most terrible feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.16,1:25:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\rEng}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.66,1:25:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,让马车回头\N{\rEng}Turn the carriage around.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.08,1:25:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你一个人去维也纳吧\N{\rEng}You go to Vienna.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.83,1:25:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,让马车回头 否则我就跳车 他要杀了他\N{\rEng}Turn the carriage around or I will jump. He's going to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.50,1:25:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,说个词吧\N{\rEng}Say one word.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.12,1:25:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一个 随便什么\N{\rEng}One word more. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.58,1:25:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你说了 我就不杀你\N{\rEng}Make me save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.91,1:25:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}-Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.87,1:25:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.50,1:26:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor! Victor!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.70,1:26:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.33,1:26:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.45,1:27:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但故事并未结束\N{\rEng}But that was not the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.79,1:27:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我试着创造生命 结果造就了死亡\N{\rEng}In seeking life, I created death.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.33,1:27:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看来又要和他们聊聊了\N{\rEng}It would seem I need to address my men again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.29,1:27:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\rEng}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.00,1:27:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会听我的话的\N{\rEng}They'll listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.20,1:28:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！别伤害他！我在这里\N{\rEng}No, no, stop! Do not harm him! I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.95,1:28:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,带走我吧\N{\rEng}Take me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.87,1:28:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 野兽\N{\rEng}Go on, beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.12,1:28:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,把我俩都杀了 证明造你的人说的都是真的\N{\rEng}Kill us both. Confirm your maker's tale.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.50,1:28:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,造我的人 说了他的故事\N{\rEng}My maker… told his tale.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.87,1:28:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也来说说我的\N{\rEng}Then I will tell you mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.16,1:28:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\shad1\bord1\1c00CCCCCC\b1}（第二部分 那头怪物的故事）
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.79,1:28:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多！\N{\rEng}Victor!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.50,1:28:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我反复呼唤你的名字 终于发现这里只有我\N{\rEng}I called your name and understood I was alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.87,1:32:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是什么？ -开枪！\N{\rEng}-What is that? -Shoot at it!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.29,1:32:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,开枪！\N{\rEng}Shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.95,1:33:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,打到了吗？\N{\rEng}Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.62,1:33:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪了？\N{\rEng}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.08,1:33:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,身上的伤口愈合了\N{\rEng}My wounds had healed.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.91,1:33:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得寒冷刺骨\N{\rEng}But I felt cold, so cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.58,1:35:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-能把火生起来吗？ -好\N{\rEng}-Can you start the fire? -All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.62,1:35:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我会尽快把畜栏修好\N{\rEng}And I'll repair the corral as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.41,1:35:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧 打到了吗？\N{\rEng}You all right, then? Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.04,1:35:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我们到处看了 就是找不到\N{\rEng}Nah, we looked everywhere. Couldn't find that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.45,1:35:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我们朝它开了两枪\N{\rEng}Though we shot at it two times.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.16,1:35:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,血迹在离这里一公里多的地方消失了\N{\rEng}Blood trail died about a mile from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.41,1:35:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好 进来吧\N{\rEng}All right. Come in. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.83,1:35:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们跟了它一段时间 接着它就消失了\N{\rEng}We followed it for a while and then it disappeared. Gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.12,1:35:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么东西？熊吗？\N{\rEng}What was it? Was it a bear?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.20,1:35:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不是熊 也不是人类 我从没见过那样的东西\N{\rEng}That was no bear or human. I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.58,1:35:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那么是幽灵吗？\N{\rEng}Was it a ghost, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.04,1:35:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 它流血了 说明它有血肉 有骨头\N{\rEng}It was no ghost. We drew blood. It was flesh and bone.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.37,1:35:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,来这边\N{\rEng}Come, come. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.70,1:35:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你还看到了什么\N{\rEng}Tell me more about what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.20,1:35:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜玛丽亚 带祖父去壁炉边\N{\rEng}Anna-Maria, take your grandfather over by the fireplace.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.20,1:35:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,让他暖一暖\N{\rEng}Make sure he's comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.79,1:35:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,到这边来 祖父\N{\rEng}Over here, Grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.37,1:35:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们钻到了森林深处 还是没找到它\N{\rEng}We went deep into the forest. Couldn't find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.62,1:36:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,会抓到它的\N{\rEng}We will get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.08,1:36:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-就是要花些时间 -好\N{\rEng}-It'll take time. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.62,1:36:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜玛丽亚 过来\N{\rEng}Anna-Maria, come.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.91,1:36:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 来带我出去\N{\rEng}Come, love. Help me outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.37,1:36:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那位老人触动了我\N{\rEng}The old man moved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.75,1:36:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他失明的双目充满智慧\N{\rEng}And his unseeing eyes were full of wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.54,1:36:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人会发出一种声音\N{\rEng}These people possessed a sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.08,1:36:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,用来和彼此\N{\rEng}Used it to tell each other
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.00,1:36:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,交流感受和想法\N{\rEng}about feelings and ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.16,1:36:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把这种声音叫言语\N{\rEng}They called them words.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.70,1:37:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,注意看\N{\rEng}Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.66,1:37:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\rEng}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.16,1:37:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一个男孩\N{\rEng}A boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.41,1:37:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-再说一遍 -一个男孩\N{\rEng}-And again. -A boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.20,1:37:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 孩子\N{\rEng}Very good, my child.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.91,1:37:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个呢？\N{\rEng}And this?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.95,1:37:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一只…一只眼睛\N{\rEng}An… An eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.79,1:37:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-再说一遍 -一只眼睛\N{\rEng}-And again. -An eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.70,1:37:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 乖孩子\N{\rEng}Yeah. Well done. Well done, my girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.79,1:37:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-眼睛 -这个呢？\N{\rEng}-Eye. -And this one?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.87,1:37:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,手\N{\rEng}The hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.91,1:37:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-很好 -手\N{\rEng}-Very good. -Hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.79,1:37:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,来搭把手\N{\rEng}Give us a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.79,1:37:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,用绳子把最大的捆住带回去\N{\rEng}Tie a rope around the biggest one back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.25,1:37:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我渴望加入这个家庭\N{\rEng}I longed to be part of this family.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.33,1:37:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,冬天之前要再多储备一些柴火\N{\rEng}We'll need more kindling before the winter.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.45,1:37:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得跑几趟\N{\rEng}We'll take a few trips.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.62,1:37:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,渴望帮他们的忙\N{\rEng}To be their benefactor.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.12,1:37:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,需要大一点的树干来搭这个\N{\rEng}We'll need larger trunks for the structure.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.91,1:37:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.83,1:37:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我能为他们做点什么呢？\N{\rEng}What could I possibly do for them?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.29,1:37:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,安娜玛丽亚！父亲！\N{\rEng}Anna-Maria! Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.33,1:37:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,快来看啊！\N{\rEng}Come! Come and see!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.50,1:38:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊 安娜玛丽亚！\N{\rEng}Look, Anna-Maria!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.16,1:38:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看 还有呢！快看！\N{\rEng}Look, there's more! Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.08,1:38:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这会是谁送来的？\N{\rEng}Who could have done this?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.87,1:38:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是森林精灵\N{\rEng}The Spirit of the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.29,1:38:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得谢谢他\N{\rEng}We should thank him.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.29,1:38:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.41,1:38:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,说“谢谢你 森林精灵”\N{\rEng}Say, "Thank you, Spirit of the Forest."
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.20,1:38:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 森林精灵\N{\rEng}Thank you. Thank you, Spirit of the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.33,1:38:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.37,1:38:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 看这里\N{\rEng}Come. Look over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.50,1:38:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.62,1:38:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,从此以后 我就成了 他们看不见的守护者\N{\rEng}From then on, I became their invisible guardian.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.16,1:38:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,森林精灵\N{\rEng}The Spirit of the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.04,1:38:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也不时对我释放小小的善意\N{\rEng}And on occasion, they too extended a small kindness towards me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.33,1:38:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,送上衣服、面包\N{\rEng}Clothes, bread.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.75,1:38:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在那段时光\N{\rEng}And for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.37,1:39:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,极为短暂的时光\N{\rEng}a brief, brief moment,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.20,1:39:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我和这个世界相安无事\N{\rEng}the world and I were at peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.70,1:39:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\rEng}Come along. Come along.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.37,1:39:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,进去吧 对\N{\rEng}In you go. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.33,1:39:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,记得关门\N{\rEng}Make sure you close that gate.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.79,1:39:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁做的呢？\N{\rEng}Who could have done this?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.66,1:39:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,森林精灵吧\N{\rEng}The Spirit of the Forest, eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.91,1:39:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\rEng}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.08,1:39:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,“最终 这个骄傲的年轻男子\N{\rEng}"And in the end, the proud young man
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.87,1:39:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,再也找不到他丢失的那只手了\N{\rEng}could never find his missing hand."
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.16,1:39:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,它变成了石头 他的财富消失了\N{\rEng}"It turned to stone, his fortune gone,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.41,1:39:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他的骄傲 他的土地 都失去了”\N{\rEng}and he lost his pride and lost his land."
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.08,1:39:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好 宝贝\N{\rEng}Very good, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.29,1:39:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,读得真棒 再读下这个吧\N{\rEng}Beautifully read. Now try this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.25,1:40:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,狼来了\N{\rEng}Wolves.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.70,1:40:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,某个想法\N{\rEng}An idea,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.83,1:40:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,某种感觉 在我心中愈发清晰\N{\rEng}a feeling became clear to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.91,1:40:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,猎人并不憎恨狼\N{\rEng}The hunter did not hate the wolf.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.33,1:41:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,狼并不憎恨羊\N{\rEng}The wolf did not hate the sheep.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.41,1:41:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但相互之间的暴力冲突无可避免\N{\rEng}But violence felt inevitable between them.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.33,1:41:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我想 也许这正是世界的法则\N{\rEng}Perhaps, I thought, this was the way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.66,1:41:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你成为猎物 被杀\N{\rEng}It would hunt you and kill you
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.12,1:41:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,只是因为你的身份\N{\rEng}just for being who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.08,1:41:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲 我月末就会把羊卖掉\N{\rEng}The sheep will be sold by the end of the month, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.25,1:41:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,然后带着你 阿尔玛和安娜玛丽亚去镇上住\N{\rEng}Then I'll take you, Alma and Anna-Maria into town.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.70,1:41:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要上山\N{\rEng}We'll go into the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.95,1:41:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,去猎几头狼 冬末回来\N{\rEng}hunt the wolves and be back at the end of winter.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.08,1:41:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我每年冬天都在这里祈祷 今年也一样\N{\rEng}I pray here alone every winter and this year will be no different.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.12,1:41:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲 求你了 听劝吧\N{\rEng}Please, Father, listen to reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.83,1:41:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你们该怎么做就怎么做 我也一样\N{\rEng}You do what you must and so will I.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.16,1:41:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,老顽固\N{\rEng}You stubborn old goat.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.25,1:41:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只有你和我了 森林精灵\N{\rEng}It's just you and I now, Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.50,1:42:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就你和我了\N{\rEng}Just you and I.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.58,1:42:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经构想了无数种方式\N{\rEng}And I had formed in my imagination many ways
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.29,1:42:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我要在这个老头面前现身\N{\rEng}I would present myself to the old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.62,1:42:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他会怕我？\N{\rEng}Would he fear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.41,1:42:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎我？\N{\rEng}Welcome me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.04,1:42:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还是会赶我走呢？\N{\rEng}Turn me away?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.75,1:42:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在那里？\N{\rEng}Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.91,1:42:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,上前一步 我进入了完全不同的世界\N{\rEng}With a single step, I entered a different world.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.37,1:42:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经我只能远远观望的世界\N{\rEng}One I had only seen from afar.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.20,1:42:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是谁？\N{\rEng}Please, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.54,1:42:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,出个声吧\N{\rEng}Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.91,1:42:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\rEng}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.41,1:42:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你来干什么的？\N{\rEng}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.33,1:42:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,路过\N{\rEng}Travel.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.79,1:42:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的过客 欢迎你\N{\rEng}Welcome, dear traveler.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.62,1:43:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,请你自己找把椅子 不要觉得我怠慢了你\N{\rEng}Do not think me ungrateful for the company if I ask you to procure a chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.50,1:43:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法周到待客\N{\rEng}I… I find it difficult being a good host.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.33,1:43:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.25,1:43:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的眼睛看不见\N{\rEng}My… My sight has failed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.66,1:43:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,桌上有面包和白兰地\N{\rEng}But there is bread and brandy on the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.75,1:43:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,请自行享用\N{\rEng}Pray help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.08,1:43:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,白兰地？\N{\rEng}Bran… dy?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.87,1:43:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,听你说话\N{\rEng}Your language.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.00,1:43:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好像不大流利\N{\rEng}You have a hard time speaking it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.91,1:43:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是从别的地方来的？\N{\rEng}Are you not from these parts?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.79,1:43:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你害怕吗？\N{\rEng}Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.62,1:43:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不用怕\N{\rEng}No need to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.87,1:43:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你在怕什么？\N{\rEng}What are you afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.25,1:43:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都怕\N{\rEng}-Everything. 
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.37,1:43:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你的…\N{\rEng}-Your…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.79,1:43:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手好冷\N{\rEng}Your hands are frozen
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.79,1:43:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你还受伤了\N{\rEng}and you've been hurt, have you not?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.54,1:43:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,受伤？\N{\rEng}Hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.50,1:44:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 你的手上和脸上都有伤疤\N{\rEng}Yes. Your hands and face have scars
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.33,1:44:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你还穿着制服\N{\rEng}and you are wearing uniform.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.04,1:44:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是在战斗中受的伤吗？\N{\rEng}Were you injured in battle?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.12,1:44:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直\N{\rEng}You were hiding
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.08,1:44:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,躲在磨坊齿轮里面 对吧？\N{\rEng}in the mill gears, were you not?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.08,1:44:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你就是森林精灵\N{\rEng}Yeah. Yeah. The Spirit of the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.33,1:44:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.04,1:44:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不到你的面容\N{\rEng}I cannot judge of your countenance,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.33,1:44:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但听你的嗓音\N{\rEng}but there is something in your voice
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.75,1:44:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定很善良\N{\rEng}which persuades me of your goodwill and kindness.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.12,1:44:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,善良？\N{\rEng}-Kindness? -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.62,1:44:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,留下来吧\N{\rEng}Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.04,1:44:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以吃我的东西 烤我的火\N{\rEng}Share my food and fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.12,1:44:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我有的不多 但能跟你分享 我会很高兴的\N{\rEng}I would be delighted to share what little I have with you
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.08,1:44:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有你陪着我 对我也大有好处\N{\rEng}and would be greatly helped by your companionship.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.33,1:44:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以读书给我听\N{\rEng}And you… you could read to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.95,1:44:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,读书？\N{\rEng}-Read? -Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.12,1:45:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,把这里当成自己家 把我当成朋友\N{\rEng}Make this your home and I your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.50,1:45:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\rEng}Friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.75,1:45:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\rEng}Friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.33,1:45:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\rEng}Friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.58,1:45:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就是在那时 我读到了我生命中第一个故事\N{\rEng}And it was then that I read my first story,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.62,1:45:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,也是《圣经》中的第一个故事\N{\rEng}and it was the first story.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.37,1:45:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,故事的主人公是一个名叫亚当的男子 和名叫夏娃的女子\N{\rEng}I read about a man named Adam and a woman named Eve,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.20,1:45:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他们住在人类的第一个乐园里\N{\rEng}about their time in the first garden.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.45,1:45:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我读到了两座城市崛起 相互竞争\N{\rEng}I read about the rise of rival cities
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.16,1:45:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一座高塔倒塌\N{\rEng}and the collapse of a tower
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.41,1:45:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝震怒毁城\N{\rEng}and the wrath of a God.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.33,1:45:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我读到人类斗巨龙\N{\rEng}And I read about men that fought dragons
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.83,1:46:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,最终失去一切\N{\rEng}and men who lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.37,1:46:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,时光流逝\N{\rEng}And time passed
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.62,1:46:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如秋叶飘落\N{\rEng}and fell away with the leaves of autumn.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.54,1:46:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的朋友 你见过下雪吗？\N{\rEng}Have you never seen the snow, my dear friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.33,1:46:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,大雪荡涤一切 让世界焕然一新\N{\rEng}It makes the world clean… and new.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.00,1:46:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,“吾乃奥兹曼迪亚斯 万王之王\N{\rEng}"My name is Ozymandias, King of Kings."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.33,1:46:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,盖世功业 敢叫天公折服\N{\rEng}"Look on my works, ye Mighty, and despair."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.95,1:46:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,此外无一物\N{\rEng}"No thing beside remains."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.75,1:46:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但见废墟周围 寂寞平沙空莽莽\N{\rEng}"Round the decay of that colossal wreck, boundless and bare."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.16,1:46:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,伸向荒凉的四方\N{\rEng}"The lone and level sands stretch far away."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.50,1:46:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,吾乃奥兹曼迪亚斯”\N{\rEng}"My name is Ozymandias…"
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.20,1:47:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,世上哪里的书比这里还多？\N{\rEng}Are there more books than this in the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.75,1:47:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定还有一些地方\N{\rEng}A few more, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.37,1:47:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这里\N{\rEng}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.83,1:47:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,左边最后 就拿那本\N{\rEng}Last book on the left. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.33,1:47:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那本还没读过\N{\rEng}We haven't got to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.45,1:47:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,弥尔顿的《失乐园》\N{\rEng}Paradise Lost, Milton.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.29,1:47:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,人类对上帝有疑问\N{\rEng}Man has questions for God.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.95,1:47:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就连上帝自己也有疑问\N{\rEng}Even God has questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.04,1:47:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得上帝也想得到答案 所以才会派来自己的儿子\N{\rEng}I think he wanted answers and that is why he sent us his son.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.33,1:47:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他很想了解死亡\N{\rEng}Death probably intrigued him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.41,1:47:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,了解受苦受难\N{\rEng}Suffering.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.45,1:47:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道我是谁\N{\rEng}I want to know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.16,1:47:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我从哪里来？\N{\rEng}Where do I come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.45,1:47:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝拿走了你的记忆 而我多么希望我的记忆也被带走\N{\rEng}God took your memory just as I wish he would take mine away.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.20,1:47:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,多年前 我拿走了某个人的生命\N{\rEng}Many years ago, I took a man's life.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.16,1:47:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个好人\N{\rEng}A good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.62,1:48:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,自那时起 我一直在赎罪\N{\rEng}And I have been atoning for it since.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.33,1:48:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,试着原谅\N{\rEng}Forgive.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.12,1:48:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,试着忘记\N{\rEng}Forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.66,1:48:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,智慧真正的试金石\N{\rEng}The true measure of wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.79,1:48:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是知道自己受了伤害\N{\rEng}To know you have been harmed,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.00,1:48:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,知道被谁伤害\N{\rEng}by whom you have been harmed,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.25,1:48:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,然后选择让一切烟消云散\N{\rEng}and choose to let it all fade.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.20,1:48:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但记不起来的东西 要怎么忘记\N{\rEng}But I cannot forget what I cannot remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.25,1:48:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么都记不起来吗？\N{\rEng}Do you recall nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.12,1:48:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,在睡梦中\N{\rEng}In my dreams…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.62,1:48:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我…能窥见记忆\N{\rEng}…I… see memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.20,1:48:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,各种各样的人\N{\rEng}Different men.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.20,1:48:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,都是…一些片断\N{\rEng}All… pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.00,1:48:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\rEng}I…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.33,1:49:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得有火 有水\N{\rEng}I remember f… fire and water.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.25,1:49:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,脚下有沙子\N{\rEng}And sand under my feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.33,1:49:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个词\N{\rEng}And a word.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.25,1:49:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就一个词\N{\rEng}A single word.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.20,1:49:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么词？\N{\rEng}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.29,1:49:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.58,1:49:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,去找到它\N{\rEng}Go to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.79,1:49:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}The word.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.75,1:50:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我终于体会到了\N{\rEng}And then I learned it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.70,1:50:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真相的可怖\N{\rEng}The horror of the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.70,1:50:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了 自己一无是处\N{\rEng}I understood that I was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.16,1:50:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是个可怜虫\N{\rEng}A wretch.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.08,1:50:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是块不起眼的污渍\N{\rEng}A blot.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.91,1:50:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至算不上是人类\N{\rEng}Not even of the same nature as man.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.25,1:50:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这种痛苦缠绕着我\N{\rEng}This hurt clung to my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.75,1:50:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,永不消散\N{\rEng}It never let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.87,1:51:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我看见了\N{\rEng}Then I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.08,1:51:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你的名字\N{\rEng}Your name.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.20,1:51:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,“维克多·弗兰肯斯坦”\N{\rEng}"Victor Frankenstein."
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.79,1:51:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了到哪里能找到你\N{\rEng}And where to find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.00,1:51:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.50,1:52:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.29,1:53:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你回来了\N{\rEng}You came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.79,1:53:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我是谁了\N{\rEng}I found what I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.29,1:53:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我是什么造就的了\N{\rEng}What I am made from.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.41,1:53:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我是尸骨堆里造出来的\N{\rEng}I am… the child of a charnel house.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.33,1:53:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是残骸\N{\rEng}A wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.91,1:53:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是用垃圾和被丢弃的尸体拼凑出来的\N{\rEng}Assembled from refuse and the discarded dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.91,1:53:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是怪物\N{\rEng}A monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.70,1:53:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\rEng}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.20,1:53:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好人\N{\rEng}A good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.20,1:53:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,也是我的朋友\N{\rEng}And… you are my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.45,1:54:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友？\N{\rEng}Friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.58,1:54:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\rEng}Friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.83,1:54:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\rEng}What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.79,1:54:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是森林里的那东西吗？\N{\rEng}The-- The thing from the woods?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.91,1:54:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你把他怎么了？\N{\rEng}What have you done to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.33,1:54:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\rEng}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.58,1:54:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快！上膛！杀了它！\N{\rEng}Quick! Reload! Kill it!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.00,1:55:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一切重回寂静\N{\rEng}There was silence again,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.33,1:56:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,而冷酷无情的生活还将继续\N{\rEng}and then… merciless life.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.87,1:56:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我死了多久？\N{\rEng}How long did I die for?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.37,1:56:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\rEng}I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.37,1:56:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但我看到身上的伤口愈合了\N{\rEng}But I saw my injuries healed.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.75,1:56:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,冬日的寒风直灌入肺\N{\rEng}The cold winter air stung in my lungs.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.50,1:56:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,孤独感更甚以往 且前所未有\N{\rEng}I felt lonelier than ever,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.62,1:56:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,因为对世人而言 治愈一切痛苦的良药\N{\rEng}because for every man there was but one remedy to all pain:
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.54,1:56:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,唯有死亡 而这恩赐你也狠心剥夺\N{\rEng}Death, a gift you too had denied me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.04,1:56:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的内心涌起羡慕之情\N{\rEng}Envy rose within me
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.08,1:56:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,遂决意向你索求一份恩典\N{\rEng}and decided to demand a single grace from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.33,1:57:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我的缔造者\N{\rEng}My creator.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.37,1:57:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要…一个同伴\N{\rEng}I would demand… a companion.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.54,1:57:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,起来吧\N{\rEng}I need you to get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.29,1:57:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Yes, of course. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.91,1:57:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,婚礼马上要开始了 你得陪在我身边\N{\rEng}The wedding will start soon and I want you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.41,1:57:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你天性善良\N{\rEng}It's hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.75,1:57:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不敢相信这话是你说的\N{\rEng}if not for your kind nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.83,1:58:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟几位宾客说了调查的事\N{\rEng}I've spoken to a few guests about the inquest.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.12,1:58:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,关于那场爆炸的调查\N{\rEng}About the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.00,1:58:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们中的大多数都接受了官方的说法\N{\rEng}The majority accept it for what it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.45,1:58:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,官方怎么说 威廉？\N{\rEng}And what was it, William?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.87,1:58:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,都过去了 维克多\N{\rEng}The past, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.62,1:58:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是场可怕的意外\N{\rEng}A terrible accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.29,1:58:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我想卖了那座庄园\N{\rEng}I intend to sell the estate.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.50,1:58:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只有彼此了\N{\rEng}All we have is each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.25,1:58:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,往四面八方撒\N{\rEng}I want you to throw the petals everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.25,1:58:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都撒一点\N{\rEng}Throw them everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.20,1:58:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,到楼上去 再多撒点\N{\rEng}Go upstairs and do some more of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.37,1:59:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 婚礼前见新娘会带来厄运\N{\rEng}I know it is bad luck to see the bride before the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.45,1:59:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,只对新郎起效\N{\rEng}Only for the groom.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.41,1:59:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 对我没用\N{\rEng}Yes, that's right. Not for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.16,1:59:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 伊丽莎白\N{\rEng}Hello, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.29,1:59:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,之前我从未感受过懊悔 而现在懊悔充斥了我的内心\N{\rEng}I've rarely felt remorse before and now I feel little else. I…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.50,1:59:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心被一种冲动占据已久 但这种感觉已经消散\N{\rEng}A fever gripped me for so long, but it has passed,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.75,1:59:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以正常地面对你了\N{\rEng}and I see you now as I should.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.45,1:59:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 我衷心祝愿\N{\rEng}For whatever it's worth, I… I wish you and my little brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.70,1:59:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我挚爱的弟弟幸福\N{\rEng}who I love more than life, the very best.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.16,1:59:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你大可以自欺欺人\N{\rEng}You may like to believe you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.16,1:59:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,而我都害怕听见\N{\rEng}And I dread to even hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.20,1:59:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是我的大喜之日 我就求你一件事\N{\rEng}On my wedding day, I ask you but for a single grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.16,2:00:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,别撒谎了\N{\rEng}No more lies.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.79,2:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-我想告诉你… -给我出去\N{\rEng}-I-- I want to tell you-- -Leave my chambers now.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.08,2:00:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-伊丽莎白 -出去！\N{\rEng}-Elizabeth. -Leave!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.08,2:01:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,出来 别躲在暗处\N{\rEng}Come out of the shadows,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.16,2:01:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你在这里\N{\rEng}if you are here.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.91,2:01:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你是来感谢我的吗？\N{\rEng}Are you here to thank me?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.75,2:01:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你活下来了 还变得足够聪明 都找到我了\N{\rEng}You survived and are intelligent enough to have found me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.29,2:01:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是我造得好\N{\rEng}I made you well.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.79,2:01:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你给我造一个同伴\N{\rEng}I need you to make a companion for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.16,2:01:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,像我这样的\N{\rEng}One like me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.29,2:01:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,同伴？\N{\rEng}A com… A companion?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.04,2:01:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\rEng}I see.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.33,2:01:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,再来个怪物\N{\rEng}Another monster.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.33,2:01:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.20,2:01:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们两个怪物作伴\N{\rEng}We can be monsters together.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.58,2:02:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我付出巨大代价 才找回了理智\N{\rEng}I have found sanity at such a cost,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.12,2:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你却想让我再回疯狂\N{\rEng}and you here… are madness calling me back.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.58,2:02:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我死不了\N{\rEng}I cannot die.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.25,2:02:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我自己\N{\rEng}And I cannot live…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.91,2:02:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我也活不好\N{\rEng}alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.16,2:02:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我造出了非常恐怖的东西\N{\rEng}In you I have created something truly horrible.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.08,2:02:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不是东西\N{\rEng}Not something.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.91,2:02:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是人\N{\rEng}Someone.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.66,2:02:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你造出了人\N{\rEng}You made someone.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.62,2:02:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\rEng}Me.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.45,2:02:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不管我多么让人费解 但我会思考\N{\rEng}Whatever puzzle I am, creator, I think.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.16,2:02:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有感受\N{\rEng}I feel.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.87,2:02:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有这一个请求\N{\rEng}I have this sole petition…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.45,2:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,再造一个像我一样的\N{\rEng}Make one like me.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.29,2:02:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\rEng}And then what?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.50,2:02:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,生育\N{\rEng}Procreation.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.00,2:03:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,繁殖\N{\rEng}Reproduction.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.45,2:03:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,建立家庭？\N{\rEng}A home?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.54,2:03:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,建造坟墓？\N{\rEng}A grave?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.54,2:03:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡与破坏不断上演\N{\rEng}Death begetting death begetting death.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.33,2:03:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,恶魔的种族在地球上蔓延\N{\rEng}A race of devils propagated upon the earth.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.66,2:03:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,肮脏永不断绝\N{\rEng}Obscenity perpetuating itself.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.41,2:03:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在你看来我很肮脏 在我看来我只是我\N{\rEng}I am obscene to you, but to myself I simply am.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.00,2:03:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开！\N{\rEng}Begone!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.62,2:03:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会再造一个 像你这么邪恶丑陋的东西\N{\rEng}Never again will I make something like you, wicked and deformed.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.29,2:03:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切还不都是 源自你的执念 维克多\N{\rEng}Then it is still all about your will, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.08,2:03:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,凭恐怖的执念造就我 如今又固执地谴责我\N{\rEng}That horrible, horrible will that birthed me condemns me now?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.70,2:03:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我开口说话算不上奇迹 你愿意倾听才算！\N{\rEng}The miracle is not that I should speak, but that you would ever listen!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.08,2:04:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你不愿赐我伴侣 我将倾泻怒火\N{\rEng}If you are not to award me love, then I will indulge in rage.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.41,2:04:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,无穷无尽的怒火\N{\rEng}And mine is infinite.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.20,2:04:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,请让一让\N{\rEng}Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.58,2:04:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.87,2:04:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\rEng}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.66,2:04:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\rEng}You…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.62,2:04:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\rEng}You…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.66,2:04:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\rEng}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.87,2:04:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,伊丽莎白 离它远一点！\N{\rEng}Elizabeth, move away from it!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.70,2:04:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.66,2:05:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西袭击了她！\N{\rEng}It attacked her! It attacked her!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.95,2:05:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,带我走吧\N{\rEng}Take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.83,2:05:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\rEng}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.20,2:06:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,别动 让我来…我能救你\N{\rEng}No, let me… I can save you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.58,2:06:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我会救活你\N{\rEng}I can save you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.33,2:06:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,救我？\N{\rEng}From what?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.41,2:06:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是害我吧\N{\rEng}From you?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.33,2:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我怕你 维克多\N{\rEng}I fear you, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.79,2:06:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rEng}No, no…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.00,2:06:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一直怕你\N{\rEng}I always have.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.95,2:06:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你的每一次疯狂和破坏\N{\rEng}Every ounce of madness and destruction.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.58,2:06:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如同大火 足以吞噬一切\N{\rEng}The very conflagration that devoured everything.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.08,2:06:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是你造成的\N{\rEng}It all came from you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.45,2:06:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是怪物\N{\rEng}You are the monster.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.04,2:07:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我和这个世界格格不入\N{\rEng}My place was never in this world.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.12,2:07:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直渴望并追寻着 一种说不清道不明的东西\N{\rEng}I sought and longed for something I could not quite name.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.58,2:07:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可在你身上 我找到了这种东西\N{\rEng}But in you, I found it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.75,2:07:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,丢失并被寻回\N{\rEng}To be lost and to be found,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:40.20,2:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是爱的宿命\N{\rEng}that is the lifespan of love.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.20,2:07:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,其短暂\N{\rEng}And in its brevity,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.87,2:07:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,其悲剧性\N{\rEng}its tragedy…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.20,2:07:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,造就永恒\N{\rEng}this has been made eternal.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.83,2:08:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就让我在你的注视之中\N{\rEng}Better this way… to fade…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.29,2:08:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,死去吧\N{\rEng}with your eyes gazing upon me.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.20,2:08:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她走了 我也想随她而去\N{\rEng}She is gone and I long to follow.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.12,2:08:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你给了我备受唾弃的生命\N{\rEng}You gave me life unwanted.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.58,2:09:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我这就还给你\N{\rEng}I give that back to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.20,2:09:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你当我是怪物\N{\rEng}You thought me a monster.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.95,2:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就让我这个怪物来回敬你\N{\rEng}Now I return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.37,2:09:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了我 现在就杀了我\N{\rEng}Kill me! Kill me now, do it!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.41,2:09:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让你流血\N{\rEng}I will make you bleed.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.00,2:09:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让你卑微求饶\N{\rEng}I will make you humble.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.87,2:09:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是造了我\N{\rEng}You may be my creator,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.12,2:09:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但从今天起 你要听我的话\N{\rEng}but from this day forward, I will be your master.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.04,2:10:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你为了猎杀我\N{\rEng}You hunted me past the forests,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.95,2:10:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,翻山越岭\N{\rEng}past the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.54,2:10:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,横跨冰川\N{\rEng}past frozen horizons,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.08,2:10:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,直到天地间\N{\rEng}until there was nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.58,2:10:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩你我\N{\rEng}Just you… and me.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.12,2:10:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,给我来点子弹\N{\rEng}I need ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.29,2:10:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这个磨快一点\N{\rEng}Sharpen this.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.79,2:10:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,来三罐炼乳 一点木柴\N{\rEng}Three cans of condensed milk, some firewood.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.04,2:10:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还有六筒炸药\N{\rEng}And six sticks of dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.58,2:10:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,六筒？\N{\rEng}Six?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.37,2:11:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你要打什么？\N{\rEng}What are you hunting?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.25,2:11:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,大的\N{\rEng}Big game.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.50,2:12:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\rEng}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:22.33,2:12:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.12,2:12:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,只有被我伤到 你才会听我说话\N{\rEng}You only listen when I hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:41.33,2:12:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 你相信这东西\N{\rEng}This. You put your faith in this.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.95,2:12:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,能够摧毁我\N{\rEng}You think this will unmake me.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.70,2:12:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,点着吧 希望如你所愿 但如果失败了\N{\rEng}Light it then and hope it does, but if it does not,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.08,2:12:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我会再来找你\N{\rEng}I will come for you again.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.79,2:12:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,点起来！\N{\rEng}Light it!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.70,2:13:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑吧\N{\rEng}Now… run.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:47.12,2:13:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 如今你残破不堪\N{\rEng}So, there you were, broken and discarded.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.75,2:13:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,而我\N{\rEng}And I,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.45,2:13:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,又活过来了\N{\rEng}alive again.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:03.04,2:14:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感到 被灼伤的血肉在重新生长\N{\rEng}I could feel my singed flesh regrowing.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.79,2:14:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,断裂的骨头重回原位\N{\rEng}The crackling of my bones resetting.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.91,2:14:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,永不停息的心脏泵出汩汩的血流\N{\rEng}The murmur of my blood pumping through my incessant heart.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.37,2:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,再次发现无人怜悯\N{\rEng}And once more finding no mercy,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.83,2:14:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我只剩一条路可走\N{\rEng}I had but one path.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.45,2:14:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终究走到了这一步\N{\rEng}And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.62,2:14:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,精疲力尽 一无所有\N{\rEng}Spent and done.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.33,2:14:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,再没有什么可以付出或索取了\N{\rEng}No more in us to give or take.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:53.20,2:14:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,帐篷外的血迹\N{\rEng}The blood outside the tent…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.12,2:14:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的\N{\rEng}It is mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.33,2:14:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的\N{\rEng}All mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.00,2:15:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我将流血\N{\rEng}I will bleed.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.83,2:15:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,疼痛\N{\rEng}Ache.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.87,2:15:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,受苦\N{\rEng}Suffer.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.12,2:15:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,永无尽头\N{\rEng}You see, it will never end.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:31.91,2:15:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:39.95,2:15:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的内心充满懊悔\N{\rEng}Regret consumes me.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:44.12,2:15:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,如今我终于能正视我的生命了\N{\rEng}And I now regard my life for what it was.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.16,2:15:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,缔造者 你要走了\N{\rEng}You will go now, creator.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.41,2:15:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要消失了\N{\rEng}Fade away.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.70,2:16:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都只是短暂的一瞬\N{\rEng}It will all be but a brief moment.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.04,2:16:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的诞生 我的悲伤\N{\rEng}My birth. My grief.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.91,2:16:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你的损失\N{\rEng}Your loss.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.95,2:16:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会受惩罚\N{\rEng}I will not be punished.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.66,2:16:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也无法摆脱罪责\N{\rEng}Nor absolved.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:20.83,2:16:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的希望\N{\rEng}What hope I had,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:23.20,2:16:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我的怒火\N{\rEng}what rage…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.54,2:16:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,都毫无意义\N{\rEng}It is all nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.20,2:16:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那股造就我的浪潮 如今要带你走了\N{\rEng}The tide that brought me here now comes to take you away.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.16,2:16:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,留下搁浅的我\N{\rEng}Leaving me stranded.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.79,2:16:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我吧\N{\rEng}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.25,2:16:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,吾儿\N{\rEng}My son.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.75,2:17:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如你有意 也请宽恕自己的存在\N{\rEng}And if you have it in your heart, forgive yourself into existence.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:06.04,2:17:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,吾儿 如果无法死去 还请细思此事\N{\rEng}If death is not to be, then consider this, my son.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.08,2:17:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,既然活着\N{\rEng}While you are alive,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.66,2:17:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,除了活下去 还有别的选择吗？\N{\rEng}what recourse do you have but to live?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:23.87,2:17:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,活着\N{\rEng}Live.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:26.62,2:17:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,说出我的名字吧\N{\rEng}Say my name.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.70,2:17:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是父亲起的\N{\rEng}My father gave me that name,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:33.12,2:17:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但其实并无意义\N{\rEng}and it meant nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:36.95,2:17:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我请求你把这个名字还给我\N{\rEng}Now I ask you to give it back to me…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.75,2:17:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次了\N{\rEng}one last time.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.95,2:17:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就像最开始 你把这个名字\N{\rEng}The way you said it at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:48.29,2:17:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当成全世界时那样呼唤我\N{\rEng}When it meant the world to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:56.29,2:17:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,维克多\N{\rEng}Victor.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:00.50,2:18:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我宽恕你\N{\rEng}I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:25.08,2:18:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,安息吧 父亲\N{\rEng}Rest now, Father.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:32.16,2:18:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,或许现在\N{\rEng}Perhaps now,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:35.45,2:18:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都能算作是人了\N{\rEng}we can both be human.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:47.37,2:18:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\rEng}Weapons down.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.00,2:18:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-放下武器 -我要为我的人负责\N{\rEng}-Put the weapons down! -I am responsible for my men.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.45,2:18:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,让他走\N{\rEng}He can leave.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.58,2:20:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,船能动了！\N{\rEng}We are free!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.75,2:20:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们自由了！\N{\rEng}We are free!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.50,2:20:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,船长\N{\rEng}Captain…
Dialogue: 0,2:20:34.79,2:20:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,您的指令是？\N{\rEng}What are your orders?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.25,2:20:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,扬帆起航\N{\rEng}Man the sails.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.83,2:20:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,掉头\N{\rEng}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:38.79,2:20:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,您要亲自宣布吗？\N{\rEng}Do you want to tell the men?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.70,2:20:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大家听好！\N{\rEng}Men!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.95,2:20:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们开船回家\N{\rEng}We're sailing home!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:44.83,2:20:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回家了\N{\rEng}We're sailing home!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.16,2:21:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\shad1\bord1\1c00CCCCCC\b1}“心会破碎 但破碎后依然跳动” 拜伦勋爵
Dialogue: 0,2:21:47.03,2:21:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}影片编剧兼导演\N吉列尔莫·德尔托罗
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.54,2:21:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\shad1\bord1\1c00CCCCCC\b1}基于玛丽·雪莱所著小说《科学怪人》改编
Dialogue: 0,2:21:56.41,2:21:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}制片人\N吉列尔莫·德尔托罗\NJ·迈尔斯·戴尔\N斯科特·斯图伯 
Dialogue: 0,2:22:01.02,2:22:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}摄影\N达恩·劳斯特森
Dialogue: 0,2:22:10.44,2:22:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}剪辑\N伊万·希夫
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.46,2:22:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}配乐\N亚历山大·德斯普拉
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.09,2:22:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}出品公司\N网飞公司
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.58,2:22:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}制作公司\N双重挑战公司
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.38,2:22:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}制作公司\N德米洛影业\N蓝草七号影业
Dialogue: 0,2:22:52.23,2:22:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}吉列尔莫·德尔托罗\N导演作品
